<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Mbalanhu Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="toc1">Onghundana Oiwa nganhyi ya shangwa kuLukasa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lukasa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Onghundana Oiwa nganhyi ya nyolwa ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKASA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Efalomo</para>
  <para style="ip">Embo ndi olya shangwa kuLukasa, a li popi kombiga yOnghundana Oiwa, lyo olyo limwe lyomomambo yane yEhangano Epe, ndi a li hokolola mo olweendonghalamwenyo lwaYesus Kilistus. Kehe limwe lyomomambo nga ohali ifanwa Evaangeli, nyi ashi ti Onghundana Oiwa. Omambo nga oya shangwa konima yeso lyaYesus kuMateusa, nokuMalukusa, nokuLukasa nokuYohanesa. Lukasa ina shanga ike ehokololo kombiga yonghalamwenyo yaYesus, ndele okwa shanga natango embo lyOilonga yAayapostoli, nhyi ashi ti “Aatumwa” ndi a li popi kombinga yoilonga mbi aalongwa yaYesus ya longa konima yeso neumuko lyaye. Kapu na nande oumwe a shiwa lela kutya Onghundana Oiwa ndji ya shangwa kuLukasa oya li ya shangwa pefimbo lipi nenge olya shangelwa peni, ndele aalongwanhu oyendji oya twa kumwe kutya olya shangwa lwopeevula omilongo heyali konima yevalo lyaKilistus.</para>
  <para style="ip">Omushangi walyo oLukasa, ngu a li omundokotola wopaunamiti. Omukalo waye wokushanga nomukalo mbu a longifa elaka awu ulike kutya okwa li omulongwanhu. Lukasa okwa li a hala okushanga ehokololo lyonghalamwenyo yaYesus li li mondjila, okupopyamo oiningwanima momukalo mbu ya ningwa, opo yamwe ya mone mo ouwa okuza moku yi lesha 1:1-3. Lukasa ka li Omuyuuda (Aakolosi 4:10-14), ndele okwa shanga momukalo mbu tau uvikiwako kaanhu mba kaye shi Aayuda. Nhyi ashi monika sha yela momukalo mbu a fatulula omifiyululwakalo vAayuuda 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Evaangeli ndi lya shangwa kuLukasa olye ifa nEvaageli ndi lya shangwa kuMateusa nokuMalukusa, shaanhyi oya hokolola oinima ye ifa momukalo wafaafana. Mokati komambo ayehe yatatu, Lukasa oye ike a popyamo unene kombiga yevalo lyaYohanesa Omushashi, ndee ta vege omufindo kombiga yeviminopo (3:3; 11:4; 17:3-4; 23:34; 24:47) nomayalikano (3:21; 5:15)</para>
  <para style="iot">Oshikalimo</para>
  <para style="io">Monhopolwa 1:1-4 Lukasa okwa ninga efalomo lyOnghundana nelalakano kutya okwe yi shangela shi.</para>
  <para style="io">Ta hokololamo evalo lyaYesus nanghee Yesus a tameka oshilonga shaye 1:5—4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Ta popi kombiga yoilonga mbi Yesus a ninga, unene nghaa oikumwifalonga noinima mbi Yesus a longa aanhu. 4:14—21:38.</para>
  <para style="io">Hwiinina, meenhopoplwa mbali vahwiininina, Lukasa okwa popyamo nghee Yesus a sa, nghee Yesus a fundikwa, nanghee Yesus a umuka. 22-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Efalomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Omusimanekwa Tiofelius. Aashangi oyendji oya longa nouviinini, ya shange oiningwanima mbi ya ningwa mokati ketu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Oya shanga nhyi twa li twa hokololelwa kumba yali ya mona nomeho yao okuza petameko, yo aayakuli yohapu yaYesus. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Onghee hano naame nhyi nda konaakona oinima ayihe okuza petameko, ondi wete shili mondjila, ndi ku shangele ehokololo lya yela omusimanekwa Tiofelius, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />opo u shiwe oshili kombiga yaayihe mbi wa longwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuvalwa kwaYohanesa Omushashi aku popiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Efimbo Helodesa a li omupangeli waYudea, okwa li kuna omuyambi wevina Sakalia, wometanga lyaAbia. Evina lyomukulukavi wae oElisapeta womezimo lyaAlona. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ayehe yaali oya li aayuuki koshipala shaKalunga. Oya li ya vulika koipango ayihe nokomaufo ayehe yOmwene. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Oyali kaye na ounona molwanhyi Elisapeta okwa li iha mono ounona. Yo ayehe oya hangika ya kulupa unene.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Esiku limwe mhanga Sakalia a li ta longo moilonga yaye youyambi mEumbo lyaKalunga, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />pamukalo mbu wa li wa landulwa kaayambi, Sakalia okwa li a hoololwa pashihoololifo opo a ka twinine mOtembeli, kokutya mEumbo lyOmwene. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Pefimbo lyetwinino, aanhu ayehe oya li ye li pondje taa yalikana.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Opo nee omuyengeli wOmwene okwe mu ihololela, a kala ofika kolulyo lwoaltali yokutwinina. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nhyi Sakalia e mu mona, okwa haluka nokwa li a tila. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ndele omuyengeli okwa ti kuSakalia: “Ino tila, eyalikano lyoye Kalunga okwe li uva. Omukiinhu woye Elisapeta oteku valele okaana okamati ndee toka luku Yohanesa. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Oto ka hafa, noyendji otaa ka hafela evalo lyako, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />oshonhyi a ka ka kala omunhu omunene koshipala shOmwene. Omaviinyu noshikumwa kehe hashi kolifa ihe keshi mwa. Ota ka uvifwa nOmhepo Ondjapuki mhanga e li mepunda lyaina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Oyendji yomoshiwana shaIsrael oteke ya alulila kOmwene Kalunga kawo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Oye omutumwa wOmwene, te ya nomhepo neenghono afa Elia. Taka hanganifa oohe noyana, ta tula oonakuhavulika mondjila ya uka, ye ta longekiva aanhu ye ilongikivile Omwene wawo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakalia okwa pula omuyengeli a ti, “Nhyi andi shi shiwa ngeepi? Oshonhyi ame onda kulupa, nomukulukavi wange naye okwa kulupa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Omuyengeli okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Aame Ngapiela, nda fikama moukali po waKalunga, ngu a tuma nge ndi ku lombwele Onghundana Oiwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nganhyi pwaikina; Molwanhyi ino itaela eehapu vage, vi a vi ka ninga voshili pefimbo lya opala, oto ka kala iho popi siyo esiku ndi ayihe mbi nda uvaneka tayi ka wanifwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Pefimbo ndyo aanhu oya li ya teelela Sakalia noya li ya kumwa kutya omolwashi a kala mo efimbo eleka motembeli. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Nhyi a zamo, okwa li iha vulu okupopya nayo. Aanhu oya vibulula kutya okwa mona emoniko motembeli. Molwanhyi Sakalia okwa li iha vulu oku popya nayo, okwe ya lombwele nokuninga omaviviliko nomake. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Omasiku yoilonga yomOtembeli nhyi ya pwa ko, Sakalia okwa shuna keumbo. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Konima yomasiku, omukulukavi waye Elisapeta okwa ningi eteelelo, nokwa kala meumbo oule weemwevi nhano ina zamo. Ndee Elisapeta okwa ti, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Omwene oye eshi niningila nge. A ningila nge ouwa nokwa kufa nge okuvinwa kaanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Evalo lyaYesus a li popiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Momwevi omutihamano weteelelo lyaElisapeta, Kalunga okwa tuma omuyengeli Ngapiela a ye komukunda Nasaleta womuGalilea. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Okwa li a pewa etumwalaka lyomukavona a yalekwa komulumhenu wevina Yosef, womepata lyaDaavid. Evina lyomukavona oMalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Omuyengeli okweya kuye ndee tati, “Ombili nai kale nooye! Omwene okuli pamwe nooye nokwe ku yambeka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia okwa li a piyaanekwa unene ketumwalaka ndi lya za komuyengeli, nokwe ipula kutya olya hala naana okutya ngeepi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Omuyengeli okwa ti kuye, “Malia, ino tila, oshonhyi owa silwa onghenda kuKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Otoka ninga omusimba, ndee toka vala okaana okamati, toka luku Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ye ota ka kala omunene, nota ka ifanwa Omona waKalunga Wokombadambada. Omwene Kalunga oteke mu ninga Ohamba nganhyi hekulu David. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Otaka kala Ohamba yoluvalo lwaYakopo, nOuhamba waye otau kala po siyo aluhe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia okwa ti komuyengeli, “Ashi shiwa ngeepi nge natango ame omukavonaelela?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Omuyengeli okwa yamukula, “Omhepo Ondjapuki otai keya kooye, neenghono vaKalunga Wokombadambada avi ka wila kombada yoye. Nomolwanhyi, okaana ngha a ka ka kala okayapuki, ko aka ka ifanwa Omona waKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Vibuluka omukwanezimo woye Elisapeta, ngu kwa itaelwa kutya ye etimhe, okuna eteelelo lyeemwevi hamano nonande ye okwa kulupa lela. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Oshonhyi kaku na sha ashi nyenge Kalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ndee Malia okwa ti, “Ame omupiya wOmwene, nandi ningilwe nganhyi wa popya.” Opo nee omuyengeli okwa zapo puye.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia ta talele po Elisapeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Pefimbo olyo tuu ndyo, Malia okwa fikama ta endelele, ndee ta yi komukunda womuYudea, koshitopolwa shi na oikulundudu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Okwa ya meumbo lyaSakalia ndee ta kundu Elisapeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Nhyi Elizabet a uva ekundo lyaMalia, okaana mepunda oka kulukuta. Opo nee Elisapeta okwa uvifwa nOmhepo Ondjapuki <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ndee ta popi mopale a ti, “Owa yambekwa mokati kaakiinhu ooyakweni, nokaana ngha ke li mepunda lyoye oka yambekwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Omolwashi ndi na okuningilwa oshinenenima nhyi, yina wOmwene wange e ya okutalela nge po? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ondaka yekundo lyoye nhyi ya fika momakutwi yange, okaana ngha ke li mepunda lyange oka nhuka kehafo. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Oumunelao, shaanhyi owa itaela kutya nhyi wa lombwelwa kOmwene ashi ka wanifwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eimbilo hambelelo lyaMalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Malia okwa ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Omwenyo wange otau hambelele Omwene, <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nomhepo yange otayi hafele Kalunga Omuhupifi wange,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />oshonhyi okwa vibulula omupiya waye mokwiihupipika kwaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Okuza Nganhyi aanhu ayehe otaa ka ifana nge omunelao,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />oshonhyi omunanghono auke okwa ningilange oinima oinene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Evina lyaye eyapuki.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ota sile onghenda ayehe mba haye mu tila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">okuza kepipi nepipi.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Okwa longa oilonga oinene nokwaako kwaye okunanghono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">ndele ta halakanifa po aainenepeki opamwe neemhangela vomitima vao.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Okwa kufa ko aapangeli aananghono koipangelapundi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">ndele ta nenepeke aaihupipiki.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Okwa kutifa mba ya sa ondjala nouwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">ndele aakengeli okwe ya taataa eenyala vashinya.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Okwe ya ku kwafa Israel omupiya wae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">mokuvibuluka esilonghenda lyaye,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nganhyi naanaa a li a uvanekela ootatekulu, Abeleham,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">noluvalo lwae siyo aluhe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia okwa kala naElisapeta oule weemwevi nhatu, ndee ta shuna keumbo lyao.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuvalwa kwaYohanesa Omushashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Efimbo lyaElisapeta lyokumona okaana nhyi lya fika, okwa mona okaana okamati. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Aashiinda naakwanezimo nhyi ya uva nghee Omwene e mu hololela onghenda onene i fike mho, oya hafela pamwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Okaana nhyi ka wanifa omasiku yahetatu, aanhu oye ya yeka pitife etanda. Oyali ya hala ye ka lukile he Sakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ndele yina okwa ti, “Aae, ota lukwa Yohanesa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Yo oya ti kuye, “Mezimo lyoye kamuna omunhu e na evina ndyo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Oya lombwela he nokuninga omaviviliko nomake opo yemu pule kutya, okaana okwa hala ka lukwe lye.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakalia okwa indila a pewe okapelende koku shanga ndee ta shanga ko, “Evina lyokaana oYohanesa.” Aanhu ayehe oya li ya kumwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Pefimbo ndyo, ewi lyaye olya fituluka nelaka olya manguluka, ndee ta tameke okupopya, ta hambelele Kalunga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Aanhu ayehe poushiinda oya kwatwa koumbada, naayihe mbi ya ningwa oya popiwa, ndele tayi tandaele noshitopolwa nhyo shoikulundudu shomuYudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Ndee ayehe mba yeshi uva, oya li yakumwa, noye ipula meemwenyo ya ti, “Mbela okaana ngha a ka ka kala ngeepi?” Ndele oya vibulula kutya, oke li momake yOmwene.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehunganeko lyaSakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />He ya Yohanesa Sakalia okwa li a uvifwa nOmhepo Ondjapuki, ndee ta hunganeke ta ti,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Omwene Kalunga kaIslael na hambelelwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Oshonhyi okweya okukwafa nokumangulula aanhu yaye.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Okwe tu pa omuhupifi ependa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">a za mezimo lyaDavid omupiya wae.”<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Okwa uvaneka okupitila maahunganeki yaye aayapuki pefimbo lyonale kutya,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />oteke tu hupifa maatondi yetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">nomomake yaayehe mba yetu tonde.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nhyi okwe shi ninga opo a ulike onghenda yaye kootate, moku vibuluka ehangano lyaye eyapuki.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Okwa ana kutate Abeleham kutya,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ote tu hupifa, momake yaatondi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">tumu longele katu na oumbada,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />opo tu ninge aayuuki naayapuki koshipala shaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">omasiku yetu ayehe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Oye mumwange, otoka ifanwa omuhunganeki waKalunga Wokombadambada.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Otoka tetekela Omwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">umu palele ondjila,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />oto ka longa aanhu yaye ya shiwe ehupifo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kupitila meviminopo lyeendjo vawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Molwolukeno nesilonghenda lyaKalunga ketu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">ota ningi eluwa lyehupifo li tu tendele,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />li minikile ayehe mba ye li momilaulu nomomuzizibwa weso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">lyo ali wilike eemhavi vetu mondjila yombili.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Okaana oka koka, ndee a ka kala ka pama pamhepo. Okwa kala mombuwa siyo esiku ndi ei hololela Aaislaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Okuvalwa kwaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateusa1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Pefimbo ndyo, ohamba Augustus oya li ya yandja omhango kutya aanhu ayehe yomoilongo mbi yi li mepangelo lyaLooma, oye na okwiinyolifa opo ya yalulwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Einyolifo ndi olyo lyali lyotango, onghee olya ningwa efimbo Kilenius ali omuleli waSilia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Aanhu ayehe oya ya yeke inyolifa, kehe umwe moshilando shawo.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosef okwa za muNasalet shomuGalilea, ndee ta yi ku Betelehem shomuYudea, mu ohamba David yali ya valelwa. Okwa ya ngho, shaanhyi okwa li omukwanezimo waDavid. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Okwa ya ekeinyolifa pamwe nomuyalekwa waye Malia, ngu ali meteelelo. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Mhanga yeli mu Betlehem, efimbo lya Malia lyokumona okaana olya fika, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />nokwa vala osheeli shaye, okaana okamati. Okwe ka tonyena melapi, ndee teka tula metemba lyokulila oimuna, shaanhyi kayali ya mona ehala monduda yaayenda.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aayengeli nAasita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Moshitopolwa mo omwa li aasita taa lifa oimuna yao pomahala youlifilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Omuyengeli wOmwene okwe ye ihololela, neyavimo lyOmwene olye ya minikile noya li ya haluka unene. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ndele omuyengeli okwa ti kuyo, “Inamu tila, ondemu etela Onghundana Oiwa, ndji tayi eta ehafo enene kaanhu ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Nena ndi, momukunda waDavid omwa valwa omuhupifi weni, Kilistus Omwene. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Nanhyi osho ashi ka kala eviviliko mu na okukoneka; Amu ka hanga okaana ka tonyenwa momalapi ka nangekwa metemba lyokulila oimuna.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mehaluko, pomuyengeli opwa holokela ongudu onene yaayengeli yomeulu, taa hambelele Kalunga taa ti:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Esimano olya Kalunga Wopombadambada,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">nombili kombada yevu maanhu e ya panda!” <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ndele aayengeli nhyi ya shuna meulu, aasita oya lombwelafana ya ti, “Tu yeni ku Betlehem, tuka tale nhyi sha ningwa ko, nhyi twa hololelwa kOmwene.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Oya ya taa endelele noya hanga Malia naYosef nokaana ka nangala metemba lyokulila oimuna. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Nhyi aasita ya mona okaana, oya hepulula nhyi ya lombwelwa komuyengeli kombinga yokaana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Naayehe mba yeshi uva oya li ya kumwa kunhyi ya hepululilwa kaasita. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ndele Malia okwa vibulula ayihe mbi, nokwa kala e na omaipulo kombiga yayo ayihe, ndee okwa kala eyi siikilila momutima wae. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Aasita oya shuna taa hambelele nokusimaneka Kalunga nomaimbilo, mwaayihe mbi ya uva nambi ya mona; mbi ya li ike naana nganhyi omweengeli a popya.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mesiku etihetatu, okaana oka pita etanda noka lukwa Yesus, evina ndi lya yandjwa komuyengeli omhanga inaka shitilwa mepunnda lyaina.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta falwa kOtembeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Oshitufi sheyelifo nhyi lyafika, nganhyi naana shali pamhango yaMoses, oya fala okaana kuYelusalema opo yeka yandjele Omwene. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Nganhyi sha shangwa momhango yOmwene kutya, “Kehe okaana kokamati kosheeli okena okuyapulilwa Omwene.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Oya ya, ndee taa yandja omayambo panghevi yomhango yOmwene, eenghuti mbali ile ounghutyona uyali. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Pefimbo ndyo, mu Yelusalema omwa li omulumenhu wevina Simeon. Okwa li omuyuuki nomutili Kalunga, ye okwa li e na omukumo wehupifo lyaIslaeli, nOmhepo Ondjapuki oye ya kombada yaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Okwa li a hololelwa kOmhepo Ondjapuki kutya iha si ina mona Kilistus Omwene. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mewiliko lyOmhepo Ondjapuki, Simeon okwa ya kOtembeli. Aakulunhu nhyi ya eta mo okaana Yesus ya ninge nhyi sha ufwa komhango, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeon okwa hinda po okaana, ndee teka ukwata, ndee ta hambelele Kalunga ta ti,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Omwene, paife owa wanifa euvaneko lyoye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">lekela nge hano, omupiya woe, ndiye nombili.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Oshonhyi onda mona ehupifo nomeho yange,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ndi wa longekiva momeho yaanhu ayehe.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ouyelele wokuhololamo ehalo lyoye kaanhu mba kaye shi Aayuuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">nesimano lyaanhu yoe Aaislaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />He naina oya li ya kuminwa eehapu vi Simeon a popya. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeon okwe ya yambeka, ndee ta ti ku Malia, “Okaana ngha oka tulwa po kuKalunga, okupundukifa nokuyambula po oyendji yomAaislaeli. Oko eviviliko lya za kuKalunga, ndele oyendji ihaye ke mu tambula, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />oiholekwa momitima voyendji otayi ke ya pouyelele, omitima veni avi ka kala noluhovi olunene, vafa va tuwa neonga lyatwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Okwa li kuna omuhunganeki omuselekavi a kulupa unene wevina Anna, omona waFanuel womezimo lyaAsel. Okwa hombolwa ndee ta kala nomulumenhu wae oule weevula heyali, nomusamane okwa hulako. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Siyo oshonhyi ena eevula omilongo hetatu nane, okwa kala natango omuselekavi. Efimbo alihe okwa kala motembeli, te inyongamene ye teivilike oikulya nokuyalikana ousiku nomutenya. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Pefimbo olyo tuu ndyo, okwe ya po, ndee ta tameke okuhambelela Kalunga, ndee ta hokolola okaana kwaayehe mba ya li ya teelela ehupifo lya Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyalukila kuNazalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Nhyi Yosef na Malia ya wanifapo ayihe pamhango yOmwene, oya shuna ku Nasalet kondoolopa yao ku Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Okaana oka koka, ndee a ka pama pamhepo, a ka uvifwa nounongo, nesilonghenda lyaKalunga olya kala kombada yako.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okaana Yesus motembeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Aakulunhu yaYesus oya li haa yi kuYelusalema, kehe ovula koshitufi shOpaasa. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesus nhyi a wanifa eevula omulongo nambali, oya ya naye koshitufi nganhyi hashi ningwa aluhe. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Oshitufi nhyi shapwa, aakulunhu oya shuna keumbo, ndele okamati Yesus oka saala muYelusalema. Aakulunhu oya li kaye shi shii kutya oku li peni. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Oya kala taye ipula kutya oku li mongudu yaayendi siyo ya enda ko oshinano shesiku limwe. Oya tameka taye mu kongo maapambelele nomaashiikile. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nhyi inaye mu mona, oyaalukila kuYerusalem yemu konge. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Konima yomasiku yatatu oye mu mona, ya hanga e li mEumbo lyaKalunga e li naalongi Aayuda, teya pwaikine ye teya pula omapulo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Ayehe mba ya li yemu pwaikina oya kuminwa eendunge nomayamukulo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Aakulunhu yaye nhyi yemu mona, oya li ya kumwa, naina okwa ti, “Mumwange, oshishi wetu ninga ngaanghyi? Se naho otweku konga notwa kala twa limbililwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Omwa kongela nge shi? Kamushi shii nani kutya ondina okukala mEumbo lyaTate?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ndele kaya li ye uvite kutya okwa hala kutya shi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Opo nee Yesus okwa shuna pamwe nayo kuNasalet, nokwa kala ta vulika kuyo. Yina okwa pungula oinima ayihe mbyo momutima wae. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesus okwa koka palutu nomeenduge, ndee ta hokiwa kuKalunga nokaanhu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Euvifo LyaYohanesa Omushashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateusa3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malukusa1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohanesa1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Movula onhimulongo nanhano yepangelo lyohamba Tibelius. Pontius Pilatus okwa li ohamba yaYudea, Helodesa okwa li ohamba yaGalilea, namumwaina Filipus okwa li ohamba yaItulea naTrakonitis, Lisanias okwa li ohamba yaAbilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Annas naKajafas oyali aayambi aakulunhu yayakwawo. Pefimbo opo tuu mho eehapu vaKalunga ova hanga Yohanesa, omona waSakalia mombuwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohanesa Omushashi okwa ya komikunda avihe vopopepi nomulonga waYordan, ndee ta uvifa kutya, aanhu ayehe naye itevulule ndee taa shashwa, opo Kalunga a vimepo eendjo vao.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Nganhyi sha shangwa membo lyomuhunganeki Jesaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ewi lyomwiingivi mombuwa ali ti;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Longekivileni Mwene ondjila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">ukililifeni omalila yaye!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Oitunu ayihe neendudu navi yelekanifwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">oikulundudu neendudu navi halakanifwe po,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">eendjila va ngonyoka navi ukililifwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">noinghulundudu nayi yelekanifwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Naanhu ayehe otaa ka mona ehupifo lyaKalunga.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Eengudu vaanhu ove ya kuYohanesa evi shashe, ndee Yohanesa okwa ti kuyo, “Luvalo nye lwomayoka! Olye e mu lombwela kutya, amu vulu okuhanikapo ehandu lyaKalunga ndi ali uya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ningeni oinima mbi tai holola kutya omweitevulula. Nye inamu tameka okwiilombwela kutya omu ho Abeleham. Oshonhyi andi mu lombwele, Kalunga ota vulu okuningila Abeleham oyana momamanya nga. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ekuwa olya tulwa pefina lyomuti, ndee kehe omuti ihau imi oiyimati oiwa otau kewapo, ndele tau ekelwa momundilo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Aanhu oye mu pula ya ti, “Otu na okuninga ngeepi hano?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Okwa yamukula ta ti, “Kehe ngu ena oikutu iyali na pe mukwawo ngu ke na sha, nangu ena oilya na pe mukwao ngu keyi na.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Aafendelifi nayo oye ya ya shashwe, ndee oya pula Yohanesa ya ti, “Omulongi, otu na oku ninga ngeepi hano?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Okwe ya lombwela, “Inamu fendelifa aanhu shivulife nhyi sha tulwa po.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Aakwaita nayo oyemu pula ya ti, “Se otu na oku ninga ngeepi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Okwa tya kuyo, “Inamu nyeka omunhu oimaliwa nye inamu lundila. Kaleni mwa wanenwa kondjabi yeni.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Eteyameno maanhu olya enda ali indjipala, noya kala nomalimbililo momitima vao kutya ngiika Yohanesa oye Kilistus. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohanesa okwe ya lombwela ayehe a ti, “Andi mu shasha nomeya, ndele aku zi ngu evule nge meenghono. Inandi wana nande okuvitula eemwiya veenghaku vaye. Ye ote ke mu shasha nOmhepo Ondjapuki nomundilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Oku na oshiyelifo momake yaye, ta kombo oshipale shaye ndee ta yele, ndee oilya teyi siikilile momaanda yaye nolungu telu fike po nomundilo ihau vimi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nomakumaivo omendji ya yooloka, Yohanesa okwa uvifila aanhu Onghundana Oiwa, ndee teya kunghulile ya aluke ko keendjila vawo ovii. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ndele Yohanesa okwa nyenyetela Helodesa omupangeli, molwanyi a hombola po Herodias omukiinhu wondege yaye nomolwouyi auhe Helodesa e wu ninga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Opo nee Helodesa okwa weva ko ali ouyi nhyi a tula Yohanesa movologo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta shashwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateusa3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malukusa1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Konima nhyi aanhu ayehe ya shashwa, naYesus okwa shashwa. Mhanga Yesus ali taa yalikana, eulu olya yeuluka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />nOmhepo Ondjapuki oya kuluka, ndee tayi mu nambele ngonghuti. Ewi olya za meulu ali ti, “Oye Omumwange omuholike, onde ku panda.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezimo lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateusa1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Pefimbo Yesus a tameka oshilongatumo shae, okwa li ena eevula vili lwopomilongo nhatu. Okwa kala nganhyi aanhu yemu vilaavilila kutya, ye omonamati waYosef yaEli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />E li yaMatati, Matati yaLevi, Levi yaMelki, Melki yaYannai, Yannai yaYosef, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosef yaMatatia, Matatia yaAmos, Amos yaNahum, Nahum yaEsli, Elsi yaNagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai yaMaat, Maat ya Matatia, Matatia yaSemei, Semei yaYosek, Yosek yaYooda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yooda yaYohanan, Yohanan yaLesa, Lesa yaSelubbabel, Selubabel yaSalatiel, Salatiel yaNeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri yaMelki, Melki yaAddi, Addi yaKoosam, Koosam yaElmadam yaEr, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er yaYosua, Yosua yaElieser, Elieser yaYorim, Yorim yaMatat, Matat yaLevi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi yaSimeon, Simeon yaYuda, Yuda yaYosef, Yosef yaYonam, Yonam yaEliakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakim yaMelea, Melea yaMenna, Menna yaMatat, Matat yaNatan, Natan yaDavid, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />David yaIsai, Isai yaObed, Obed yaBoas, Boas yaSalmon, Salmon yaNashon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon yaAminadab, Aminadab yaAdmin, Admin yaArni, Arni yaHezron, Hezron yaPeres, Peres yaYuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda yaYakop, Yakop yaIsak, Isak yaAbeleham, Abeleham yaTela, Tela yaNahol, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahol yaSeluh, Seluh yaLehu, Lehu yaPeleg, Peleg yaEbel, Ebel yaShela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela yaKainan, Kainan yaAlfasad, Alfasad yaSem, Sem yaNoa, Noa yaLamek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek yaMetusala, Metusala yaEnok, Enok yaYared, Yared yaMahalalel, Mahalalel yaKainan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainan yaEnos, Enos yaSet, Set yaAdam, Adam yaKalunga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta makelwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateusa4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malukusa1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesus okwa zako komulonga waYoldan, a uva Omhepo Ondjapuki. Okwa wilikwa kOmhepo ndee tayi mu fala mombuwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Okwa kala mo oule womasiku omilongo ne ina lya sha. Momasiku nga, okwa kala ta shongwa kuSatana. Omasiku omilongo ne nhyi ya pwako, Yesus okwa li a sa ondjala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Satana okwa ti kuye, “Nge oye Omona waKalunga lombwela emanya ndi li shituke omboloto.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Okwa shangwa, ‘Ha komboloto ike omunhu ta kala e na omwenyo.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Satana okwe mu kufa pamhepo, ndee temu fala mouleka, ndee temu ulikile omauhamba ayehe yomouyuni mepakumo lyeiho. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Satana okwa ti kuyeeye, “Andi ku pe eenghono nepangelo, nomauyamba ayehe. Oshonhyi ayihe mbi onde yi pewa, ndee andi vulu kuyi pa kehe ngu nda hala. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ayihe mbi ota yi ningi yoye ngeege to inyongamene nge nongeege to yalikana nge.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula ta ti, “Okwa shangwa, ‘Omwene Kalunga koye oye auke una kwiinyongamena, ye oye auke una okulongela.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Satana okwe mu fala kuYelusalema, ndele te mu londeke kohulo yotembeli, ndee ta ti kuye, “Ngeege oye Omona waKalunga iyundulila pevu. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Oshonhyi okwa shangwa, ‘Omwene Kalunga koye ota lombwele aayengeli yeku amene, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />taye ku hindipo momaako yao opo uheyi pume omhavi yoye kemanya.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ndele Yesus okwe mu yamukula ta ti, “Okwa ti, ‘Ino shonga Omwene Kalunga koye.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Satana nhyi a mana okushonga Yesus, Satana okwa fiyapo Yesus mhanga.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta tameke oilonga yaye muGalilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateusa4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malukusa1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Opo nee Yesus okwa yalukila muGalilea, neenghono vOmhepo Ondjapuki ova li pamwe naye. Onghundana kombiga yaye oya tandaela nomikunda avihe. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Okwa longa mOinangoga, naayehe oya li yemu popila mouwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta anywa kuNasaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateusa13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malukusa6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesus okwa ya kuNasaleta, koshilando nghu a putukila. Mesiku lyEsabati okwa ya kOshinangoga nganhyi ha ningi shito. Okwa fikama a leshe Omishangwa omiyapuki, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />nokwa pewa embo lyomuhunganeki Yesaya. Hano nhyi a tonyununa omishangwa, okwe itwa poima pwa shangwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Omhepo yOmwene oyi li kombada yange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">oshonhyi okwa hoolola nge ndi lombwele eehepele Onghundana Oiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Okwa tuma nge ndi uvifile eenghwatwa emanguluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">aaposi ya twikuluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">okumangulula oonakuhepekwa<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />noku uvifa kutya efimbo olya fika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">ndi Omwene te ya a hupife aanhu yaye.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesus nhyi a mana okulesha, embo okwe li pa omuyakuli, ndee ta kala omutumba, nomeho yaayehe mOshinangoga oya li ye mu tongolola, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />nokwa ti kuyo, “Omishangwa vi mwa uva va leshwa nena ova wanifwa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Yo ayehe oye mu popila mouwa noya li yemu hokwa, noya li ya kuminwa eehapu oviwa, vi va za mokanya kaye noya ti, “Hano keshi omona waYosef ngu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Ondi shi shii kutya omwa hala kulombwela nge eele ndi, ‘Ndokotola, iyeluva.’ Nomwa hala natango okutya ‘Ninga oikumwifalonga momukunda weni nghanhyi mbi wa ninga muKapelenaum.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ndele andi mu lombwele oshili, “Kaku na omuhunganeki ha tambulwako nawa kaanhu yomoshilongo shambilyao.”<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />“Pwaikineni ndi mu lombwele oshili, muIslaeli omwa li aaselekavi oyendji pefimbo lyomuhunganeki Elia, nhyi kwa li inaku lokwa oule weevula nhatu noshitata, nomwa li ondjala onene moshilongo ashihe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ndele Elia ka li a tumwa nande okuumwe womaaselekavi mba, ndele okwa tuminwe ike komuselekavi wokuSalefat moshitopolwa shaSidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />MuIslaeli omwa li natango muna aanashilundu oyendji pefimbo lyomuhunganeki Elisa, ndee Elisa ina eluva nande umwe womuyo, oNaeman ike Omusilia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Aanhu mba yali mOshinagoga nhyi ya uva eehapu vi, oya hanya neenghono. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Oya kwata Yesus ndee taye mu kufamo moshilando, ndee taye mu fala komungege wondudu nghu kwa li kwa tungilwa oshilando shao, opo yemu undulile pevu. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ndele Yesus okwa pita mokati kao, ndee ta yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulumenhu e na omhepo ya kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Malukusa1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ya kuKapelenaum, oshilando shi li muGalilea, ndee ta longo aanhu mesiku lyEvululuko ndi ha li ifanwa Esabati. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Aanhu oya li ya kuminwa elongo lyaye, oshonhyi eehapu vaye ova li vi na eenghono nepangelo. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />MOshinangoga omwa li omulumenhu e niwe komhepo ya kaka. Omulumhenhu okwa ingiva mopale ta ti, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Oihuna oyi fike peni! Yesus Omunasaleta owe tu halela shi? Owe ya u tu hanaune po? Ondi ku shii kutya oye omuyapuki waKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesus okwa hanyena omhepo ya kaka a ti, “Mwena, ndee to zimo muyeeye!” Omhepo ya kaka oya vega omulumenhu ngo pevu momeho yaanhu, ndee tai zimo muye inai mu ningila ouyi washa. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Aanhu ayehe oya li ya kumwa noya pulafana ya ti, “Eehapu va tya ngeepi vi? Ta lombwele eemhepo va kaka nepangelo neenghono, ndee avi zimo?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Onghundana kombiga yaYesus oya tandaela apehe momikunda vomoshitopolwa nhyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva aanhu oyendji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateusa8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malukusa1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesus okwa za mo mOshinagoga ndee ta yi meumbo lyaSimoni. Yinamweno yaSimoni okwa li ta aluka olwiivi neenghono, noya pula Yesus e mu kwafele. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesus okwa heena kuye, ndee ta hanyene olwiivi, nolwiivi olwe mu efa. Meendelelo okwa fikama po ndee te ya longekivile oikulya. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Etango nhyi lya ningina, aanhu ayehe mba ya li ye na aanauvu yomauvu ya yooloka, oye ya eta kuYesus. Yesus okwa tenheka omake yaye kukehe omunauvu ndee te ya eluva ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Neemhepo va kaka ova zamo maanhu oyendji avi ingiva avi ti, “Oye Omona waKalunga!” Ndee Yesus okwe vi hanyena, inevi pitika vi popye, shaanhyi ovi mu shii kutya oye Kilistus.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta uvifa mOshinagoga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Malukusa1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Nhyi kwasha, Yesus okwa zamo moshilando, ndele ta yi eke ikalela. Aanhu oye mu konga, nanhyi ye mu mona oya kambavala oku mu kwatela po aha ze po puyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ndele okwa ti kuyo, “Ondi na okuuvifa Onghundana Oiwa yOuhamba waKalunga nomoilando ikwao, shaanhyi Kalunga osho a tuma nge ndi ninge.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Okwa twikila nokuuvifa mOinangoga yomuYudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta ifana aalongwa yotango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateusa4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malukusa1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Esiku limwe Yesus nhyi a li a fikama pefuta lyaGenesaleta, aanhu oye mu ongalela, ya pwaikine ohapu yaKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Okwa mona eewato mbali vili pomukunghulo wefuta, ndele aakwati yeehi oya hangika kaye li po yaka koha eenhete vao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesus okwa ya muimwe yomeewato vo, mundji yaSimoni, nokwe mu pula e yi heenife komeho kanhiki, yi ze ko komunghulo wefuta. Yesus okwa kala omutumba mowato ndjo, ndee ta longo ongudu yaanhu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Nhyi a mana okupopya, okwa lombwela Simoni a ti, “Ukifa owato mokati kefuta, ndee amu umbile eenhete veni momeya mu kwate eehi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Mulongi, ousiku auhe otwa longa nouviinini ndele inatu kwata ko sha, ndele shaanhyi owa popya, eenhete andi vi tula mo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nhyi ye shi ninga, oya kwata eehi ovidji, neenhete vao ova li a vi hala okutokoka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Oya lapa yakwao ya li mowato onghwao, opo ye uye ye ya kwafele. Oye ya, ndee taa uvifa eewato avihe mbali neehi, neewato ova li a vi hala okuningina molwouviyu. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ndee Simoni Peetulusa nhyi a mona nhyi sha ningwa po, okwa twa eengolo koshipala shaYesus ndee ta ti, “Omwene, za po pwaame, shaanhyi ame ondimulunde!.”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Peetulusa naayehe mba ya li naye oya li ya kuminwa eehi ovidji vi ya kwata. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Osho nghaa naYakopo naYohanesa, oyana yaSebedeus, mba ya li aakwati yeehi naSimoni. Yesus okwa ti kuSimoni, “Ino tila, okuza nena oto ningi omukwati waanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Konima yanhyo, oya fala eewato vao komutunda, ndee taa fiipo oinima yao ayihe ndee taa landula Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu e na oshilundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateusa8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malukusa1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Esiku limwe Yesus okwa li moshilando shonhumba, mo omwa li omulumenhu e na oshilundu. Omunashilundu nhyi a mona Yesus, okwa twa eengolo koshipala shaYesus, ndee te mu indile ta ti, “Omusimanekwa, nge ouna ehalo, yeleka nge.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesus okwa elufa eke lyaye, ndee te mu kumu, ndee ta ti, “Onda hala, yela.” Viyaviya oshilundu oshe mu efa ndee ta yela. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesus okwe mu kumaiva neenghono a ti, “Inda, ndele ino shi popya nande okulye. Inda ike uke iyulike komuyambi, oye to yandja omaano yealuvo, nga ya ufwa kuMoses, nakehe umwe a mone kutya owa eluka.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ndele nande ongaanhyo, onghundana kombinga yaYesus oya tandaela shi vulife nale. Aanhu oyendji oye ya oku mu pwaikina nokweeluvwa komikifi vi ya li ye na. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ndele Yesus okwa kala ha yi kokule naanhu, taka yalikana.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omusilombada</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateusa9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malukusa2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Esiku limwe Yesus nhyi a li ta longo aanhu, Aafalisai naalongimhango nayo opo ya li omutumba, ya za komikunda avihe vomuGalilea nomuYudea nokuYelusalema. Neenghono vOmwene ova li muye, oku eluva aanhu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Aalumenhu yamwe oya etela Yesus omusilombada ye mu hinda poshiinda. Oya kambavala oku mu fala meni lyeumbo ndyo, ye mu nangeke komeho yaYesus, <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />ndele molwoundji waanhu, oya li ya nyengwa okushi ninga. Oya londa naye kombada yeumbo, ndee taa ulula ombululu kombada yonduda, ndee taye mu kulukifile noshiinda shaye pevu, mokati kaanhu siyo ta fiki puYesus. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesus nhyi a mona eitaelo lyao, okwa lombwela omusilombada, “Eendjo voye ova vimwapo kaume kange.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ndele aalongimhango nAafalisai oya tameka okupopya taa ti, “Ngu oye lye ta tuku Kalunga? Kaku na nande omunhu ta vulu okuvima po eendjo, oKalunga auke.” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesus nhyi a vibulula nhyi taa vilaavila, okwa ti kuyo, “Omolwashi amu vilaavila ngaanhyo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nhyi oshipu shipi? Oku lombwela omusilombada, ‘Eendjo voye ova vimwa po, nenge oku mu lombwela, fikama u ende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Onda hala mu kale mu shi shii kutya, Omona wOmunhu oku na epangelo kombada yevu okuvima po eendjo.” Yesus okwa ti komusilombada, “Andi ku lombwele, fikama, kufa oshiinda yoye, ndee toyi keumbo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Omulumenhu okwa fikama viya monhaneho yaanhu, ta kufa ombete yaye, ndee ta yi kolyawo, ta ende ta hambelele Kalunga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Aanhu ayehe oyali ya kumwa, ndee taa hambelele Kalunga ya ti, “Nena otwa mona oinyenganduge oinene.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta ifana Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateusa9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malukusa2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Konima yambi, Yesus okwa ya pondje. Okwa mona po omufendelifi wevina Levi, e li omutumba ponduda yomafutilo, ndee ta ti kuye, “Landula nge.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Levi okwa fikama ndee ta fii po ayihe ndee te mu landula.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Levi okwa ningila Yesus oshitufi oshinene meumbo lyaye. Maahiwa omwa li ongudu onene yaafendelifi naanhu yamwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Aafalisai yamwe naalongimhango yamwe yomongudu yao oya nyenyeta kaalongwa yaYesus ya ti, “Omolwashi amu li nye amu mu pamwe naafendelifi naalunde?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Mba ye na oundjolowele inaa pumbwa ndokotola, ndele aanauvu oyo ya pumbwa ndokotola. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Oshonhyi ame inandi uya okwiifana aayuuki, ndele onde ya okwiifana aalunde ye itevulule.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta pulwa kombiga yokwiivilika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateusa9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malukusa2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Aanhu yamwe oya ti kuYesus, “Aalongwa yaYohanesa oha ye ivilike nokwaalikana olundji, naalongwa yAafalisai osho haa ningi, ndele aalongwa yoye ihaye ivilike.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Ookaume komuhomboli otaa vulu nghaa okwiivilika mhanga omuhomboli e li puyooyo?” <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ndele omasiku otae ya, nhyi omuhomboli taka kufwa po puyooyo, opo nee taa ka vula okwiivilika. <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Okwe ya lombwela eele ali ti, “Kaku na omunhu ta kufa oshaando koshikutu oshipe, ndee teshi tula koshikutu oshikulu. Nge oteshi ningi, ota nyonauna po oshikutu oshipe. Oshaando oshipe ihashi opalele koshikutu oshikulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Omaviinyu omape ihaa zilwa momhunda yoshipa onghulu, nge umwe teshi ningi, omaviinyu omape nhyi taa pi, otaa taula omhunda, ndee taa tika mo, nomhunda tayi nyonauka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Omaviinyu omape oye na okuzilwa meemhunda eemhe. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ko kaku na ngu a ikilila omaviinyu omakulu ta hala omaviinyu omape, shaanhyi ota ti, ‘omakulu omawa.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Epulo kombiga yeSabati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateusa12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malukusa2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Mesiku limwe lyEvululuko lyAayuda ha li ifanwa Esabati, Yesus okwa pita mokati komapya. Aalongwa yaye oya teya omitwe voilya ndee taa fengele eemuma pomake yao ndee taa li. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Aafalisai yamwe oya pula ya ti, “Omolwashi amu ningi nhyi inashi pitikwa okuningwa pamhango mEsiku lyEvululuko?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesus okwa yamukula a ti, “Nani ina mu lesha, nhyi David naanhu yaye ya li ya ninga nhyi ya li ya sa ondjala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />David okwa ile mOtembeli, ndee ta kufa mo eemboloto vi va li va yambelwa Kalunga, ndee ta pe naanhu yaye. Eemboloto kava li va pitikwa okuliwa komunhu kehe, ndele okaayambi ayeke.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesus okwa ti, “Omona womunhu oye Omwene wEsiku lyEvululuko.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulumenhu e na oshikaha sha lemana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9">Mateusa12:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malukusa3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mesiku lyEvululuko ekwao, Yesus okwa ya mOshinagoga, ndee ta longo aanhu. MOshinagoga omwa li omulumenhu e na oshikaha shokolulyo sha lemana.<verse eid="LUK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Yamwe yomaalongimhango nayamwe yomAafalisai oya li ya hala etomhelo lyokulundila Yesus, onghee oya kala ye mu kotokela, ya tale nge ota eluva mEsabati. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yesus okwa vibulula omavilaavilo yao, nokwa ti komulumenhu woshikaha sha lemana, “Fikama, ila komeho.” Omulumenhu okwa fikama, ndee ta yi komeho. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Oshishi sha pitikwa okulongwa mEsiku lyEvululuko, okulonga ouwa ile okulonga ouyi, okuhupifa omwenyo ile okuwu kanifa?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesus okwa tala oipala yaayehe mba ya li po omutumba, ndee ta lombwele omulumenhu ngo ta ti, “Ukililifa oshikaha shoye.” Omulumenhu okwe shi ukililifa, noshikaha shaye osha yeluka.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Aafalisai naalongimhango oya li ya handukila Yesus neenghono, noya kundafana kombiga yanhyi ye na oku mu ninga.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta hoolola aatumwa omulongo nayaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateusa10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malukusa3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Limwe lyomomasiku ngo, Yesus okwa ya kondudu a ka yalikana. Okwa kala ko ousiku auhe ta yalikana kuKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Nhyi kwa sha, okwa ifana aalongwa yaye ayehe, ndee ta hoolola mo aalongwa omulongo nayaali, ndee teya luku Aayapostoli kokutya Aatumwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Oya li nee, Simoni, ngu Yesus a luka Peetulusa, namumwaina Andiliasa, naYakopo naYohanesa naFilipusa naMbatolomeus, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateusa naTomasa naYakopo naAlfeusa, naSimoni (ngu ha ifanwa kutya okuhole oshilongo shaye), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />naYudas yaYakopo naYudas Iskaliot ngu a ka kengelela Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta longo ye ta eluva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateusa4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesus okwa londoloka ko kondundudu pamwe nAatumwa omulongo nayaali. Okwa fikama pehala lya yelekana, pamwe nongudu onene yaalanduli yaye. Opwa li ongudu yaanhu ya za muYudea ashihe noyomuYelusalema nomoilando yopomunghulo wefufa Tilus naSidon, ye uya oku mu pwaikina nokueluvwa komauvu yao, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />na mba ya li ya hepekwa keemhepo va kaka oya eluvwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Naanhu ayehe oya kala ya hala oku mu kuma, shaanhyi muye omwa li amu zi eenghono, va eluva ayehe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehafo noluhovi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateusa5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesus okwa tala kaalongwa yaye, ndee ta ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Aanelao onye mba mwa hepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">oshonhyi ouhamba waKalunga oweni.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Aanelao onye mba mwa sa ondjala nganhyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">oshonhyi amu ka kutifwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Aanelao onye mba amu lili nganhyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">oshonhyi amu ka yola.”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Aanelao onye, ngeege aanhu taye mu tondo, taye mu anya, taye mu tuku, taye mu ula nayi molwa Omona wOmunhu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nge amu shi ningilwa hafeni, ndee amu vana, molwanhyi ondjabi yeni onene oyi li meulu. Oshonhyi noohe osho ya ningile aahunganeki.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ndele oihuna oifike peni kunye mba aakengeli nganhyi ndji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">omwa lumba eenghalamwenyo veni moulinawa ndee ashi ka kala oshiviyu kunye.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Oihuna oifike peni kunye mba mwa kuta nganhyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">oshonhyi amu ka sa ondjala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Oihuna oifike peni kunye mba amu yolo nganhyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">oshonhyi amu ka nyika oluhovi nye amu ka lila.”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Oihuna oifike peni nge aanhu ayehe taye mu popile mouwa, oshonhyi noohekulu osho ya popile kaahunganeki aanaipupulu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Holeni aatondi yeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateusa5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ndele nye mba mwa pwaikina nge andi mu lombwele, holeni aatondi yeni, mba ye mu tonde ya ningileni ouwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />yambekeni mba taye mu fingi, yalikaneneni mba taye mu sheke. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ngu teku vege kolupanda lumwe, mu efa a vege nokulukwao. Ngu teku kufa oshikutu shokombada, nanhyi shokohi shi mu pa. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Kehe ngu teku indile, mu pa, nangu teku kufa sha, ino shi mu pula eshiku alulile. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ningileni yakweni nhyi mwa hala okuningilwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Nge omu hole ike mba yemu hole, amu mono epandulo lyashi? Oshonhyi naalunde oye hole ike mba ye ya hole. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nge amu ningile ike ouwa mba haye mu ningile ouwa, amu mono epandulo lyashi? Oshonhyi naalunde osho haa ningi. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ngeege amu yandja ike kumba mwa teelela yeshi mu yalulile, amu mono epandulo lyashi? Shaanhyi naalunde ohaa yandja ike kaalunde, ya yalulilwe shi fike punhyi ya li ya yandja. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ndele nye, holeni aatondi yeni, nye mu ya ningile ouwa. Yandjeni, nye muha teelele okuyalulilwa sha, opo ondjabi yeni yi ninge onene, nye mu ninge oyana yaKalunga Wopombadambada. Oshonhyi ye omuwa kumba ihaa pandula nokumba aalunde. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Kaleni mu na onghenda nganhyi Ho weni e na onghenda.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okupangulafana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateusa7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Inamu pangula yakweni opo Kalunga inemu pangula. Inamu tokola opo Kalunga inemu tokola. Viminafaneni po, opo mu viminwe po. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Yandjeni opo Kalunga e mu pe. Amu ka pewa oshiyelekifo sha uva, ashi hunga, sha findwa, ashi tika, ndele ashi tulwa momakolo yeni. Oshonhyi oshiyelekifo nhyi amu yelekele nasho yakweni, osho nghaa Kalunga teke mu yelekela nasho.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesus okwe ya lombwele eele a ti, “Omuposi ota vulu nghaa okukwata mukwao koshiti? Ayehe yaali ihaa wile melambo? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kakuna omulongwa e vule omulongi waye, ndele nge omulongwa a mana okulongwa, opo ta kala e fike pomulongi waye.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ongeepi u wete okambodi meiho lyamukweni, oye kuwete endagalati meiho lyoye mwene? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ongeepi to vulu okulombwela mukweni, ‘Kaume, andiya ndi kufe mo okambodi ke li meiho lyoye,’ ndee endagalati ndi li li meiho lyoye ku li wete? Mwiiningifi ooye, kufamo tango endagalati ndi li li meiho lyoye opo u vule okumona okambodi ngha ke li meiho lyamukweni.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omuti noiyimati yawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateusa7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Omuti omuwa ihau vulu okwiima oiyimati oiyi, nomuti omwii ihau vulu okwiima oiyimati oiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kehe omuti ohau vibululwa koiyimati yao. Eenghwiyu ihavi vulu okulikolwa komano, nomandjebele ihaa vulu okulikolwa koshihwa sheno. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Omunhu omuwa ota holola ouwa kuza momutima waye omuwa. Osho nghaa nomunhu omwii, ota holola ouyi kuza momutima waye omwii. Oshonhyi okanya ohaka popi nyi sha siikililwa momutima.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aatungingulu yaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateusa7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Omolwashi hamu ifana nge, ‘Omwene, Omwene,’ ndee ihamu longo nhyi andi mu lombwele? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Kehe ngu te ya kwaame ndee ta pwaikine eehapu vage ndee ta vulika kuvo, nandi mu pe oshihoolelwa kutya okwa fa shi. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Okwa fa omunhu ta tungu eumbo, ta fe mopale ndee ekanghameno te li tungile kemanya. Eelu olye ya, nefundja olya panuka ko ndee a li hanga eumbo ndi, ndele inali teka po, shaanhyi olya li lya kola. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ndele kehe ngu ta uvu eehapu vage, ndee iha vulika kuvo, okwa fa omunhu a tungila eumbo lyaye peheke, ina tungila po ekanghameno lyasha. Eelu nhyi lye ya, eumbo olya teka po, nekumauko lyalyo olya li enene.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 7</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omupiya womukulunhu waakwaita waLooma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateusa8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesus nhyi a mana okupopya kaanhu ayihe mbi, okwa ya kuKapelenaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Omukulunhu waakwaita waLooma okwa li e na omupiya waye, ngu a li a simaneka, taaluka e li pokusa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Nhyi omukulunhu waakwaita a uva kombiga yaYesus, okwa tuma aakulunhu yaaYuuda kuYesus, ye mu indile opo a ye a ka eluve omupiya waye. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Oye ya kuYesus ndee taye mu indile ya manamo ya ti, “Omulumenhu ngu okwa wana okukwafwa kwooye, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />molwanhyi okuhole aanhu yetu, ye okwetu tungila nOshinagoga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesus okwa ya nayo, ndee mhanga ye li pokufika, omukulunhu waakwaita okwa tuma ookaume kaye kuYesus ye mu lombwele taa ti, “Omwene, inandi hala wu ihepeke, oshonhyi ame inandi opala wuuye mo meumbo lyange. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Sho osho naame inandi opala nduuye kwooye. Popya ike ohapu imwe, omupiya wange ota eluka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Oshonhyi naame omunhu ndi li kohi yepangelo, nondi na aakwaita mepangelo lyange. Andi lombwele ngu, ‘Inda!’ Ndee ota yi. Andi lombwele mukwao, ‘Ila’! Ndee ote ya. Andi lombwele omupiya wange, ‘Ninga nhyi’, Ndee oteshi ningi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Nhyi Yesus eshi uva, okwa li eshi kuminwa. Okwa punguluka ndee ta taalele kongudu yaanhu ndji ya li ye mu landula, ndee ta ti, “Andi mu lombwele, inandi mona nande onale eitaelo lya fa mha, nomuIslaeli inandi li mona mo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Hano mba ya li ya tumwa oya shuna keumbo lyomukulunhu waakwaita, ya hanga omupiya a eluka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta umuva omonamati womuselekavi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Inapu pita efimbo eleka, Yesus okwa ya komukunda wevina Nain, pamwe naalongwa yaye nongudu onene yaanhu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Nhyi a fika posheelo shomukunda mbo, okwa shakenapo naanhu ya hinda omuviba taye kewu fundika. Nakusa okwa li e ivalelwa, nayina okwa li omuselekavi. Nongudu onene yaanhu yomomukunda mo oya ya pamwe naina yanakusa. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Nhyi Omwene a mona omuselekavi, okwe mu uvila olukeno ndee ta ti kuye, “Ino lila ali.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yesus okwa heena popepi, ndee ta kumu mha pwa hindwa omuviba, naahindi yomuviba oya kanghama. Yesus okwa ti, “Mumati omunyasha, andi ku lombwele, penduka po!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Omumati okwa penduka ndee ta tameka okupopya. Yesus okwe mu yandja kuyina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Aanhu oya li ya tila, noya hambelela Kalunga ya ti, “Omuhunganeki omunene a holoka mokati ketu. Kalunga okwe ya a hupife aanhu yaye!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ehokololo kombiga yaYesus olya tandaela naYudea nomoitopolwa yopoushiinda.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aatumwa ya za kuYohanesa omushashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateusa11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Aalongwa yaYohanesa Omushashi oye mu hokololela ayihe mbi ya ningwa kuYesus. Yohanesa okwa ifana yaali yomaalongwa yaye, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ndee te ya tumu kOmwene yeke mu pule, “Ooye nghaa nakuuya nenge otu na okuteelela umwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Aalongwa yaYohanesa nhyi ya fika kuYesus oya ti, “Yohanesa Omushashi okwe tu tuma tukupule nge ooye nghaa nakuuya nganhyi ta ti, nenge otuna oku teelela umwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Pefimbo ndyo, Yesus okwa yeluva aanhu oyendji komauvu yao, komikifi nokeemhepo va kaka, nokwa monifako omeho yaaposi oyendji. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesus okwa yamukula aalongwa yaYohanesa a ti, “Shuneni muka hokololele Yohanesa ayihe mbi mwa mona nambi mwa uva; Aaposi otaa mono ko, oilema otai ende, aanashilundu otaa yela, aafitamakutwi otaa uvu ko, aasi otaa umuvwa, neehepele avi uvifilwa Onghundana Oiwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Omunelao oye ngu iha limbililwa nge.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Nhyi aatumwa yaYohanesa ya ya, Yesus okwa tameke okuhepululila eengudu vaanhu kombiga yaYohanesa ta ti, “Mombuwa omwa ile mo mu ka tale shi? Enenge a li nyengaanyengifwa komhepo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Nenge omwa ile mu ka tale shi? Omunhu a zala oikutu yondilo? Ahawe, mba haa zala oikutu yondilo oye li mouwa meembala veehamba. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Nenge omwa li mwa teelela mu mone shi? Omuhunganeki mbela? Oshili andi mu lombwele, Ye oku vule omuhunganeki. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Oye tuu ngu a shangwa kwa ti, ‘Tala, andi ku tetekelifile omutumwa wange, teku longekivile ondjila.’” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesus okwa twikila ko ta ti, “Andi mu lombwele, Yohanesa okuvule ayehe mba ya valwa pambelela, nangu omushona e vulike kwaayehe mOuhamba waKalunga, oye e vule Yohanesa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Aanhu ayehe naafendelifi mba ya li ya pwaikina euvifo, oya vulika kouyuuki waKalunga, ndee taa shashwa kuYohanesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ndele Aafalisai naalongimhango inaa vulika kehalo lyaKalunga, onghee oya anya okushashwa kuYohanesa.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesus okwa twikila ko, “Nganhyii, aanhu yopefimbo ndi andi ya yeleke nashi? Oya fa shi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Oya fa ounona u li omutumba pomalandifilo tau ingivile ukwao tau ti, ‘Otwe mu pandulila, ndele ina mu tutula ouvano. Otwa imba omaimbilo yeesa, ndele ina mu lila.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Oshonhyi Yohanesa omushashi okwe ya, te ivilike, ye iha mu omaviinyu, ndele nye amu ti, ‘Ye oku na eemhepo va kaka.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Omona wOmunhu okwe ya, ta li ye ta mu. Ndee amu ti, ‘Tala komufukanhu nokongholwe, kaume kaafendelifi nokaalunde.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ounongo waKalunga owa hololwa wa yuuka kwaayehe mba yemu tambula”.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus molyaSimoni Omufalisai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Wumwe womAafalisai okwa hiya Yesus a ka lye oulalelo pamwe naye. Yesus okwa ya meumbo lyOmufalisai, ndee ta kala omutumba poshililo a lye. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Moshilando omwa li omukiinhu a lumba moulunde. Nhyi a uva kutya Yesus oku li meumbo lyOmufalisai ta li, okwe ya mo e na oshikola shomaavi ya nyika nawa unene. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Okwa fikama konima yaYesus peemhavi vaye. Okwa tameke oku lila ta moteke eemhavi vaYesus nomahovi yaye, nokwe vi puula neehuki vokomutwe waye. Okwa simaneka Yesus nokuhupita eemhavi vaye, ndee tevi yaeke nomaavi ya nyika nawa. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ndee Omufalisai ngu a hiya Yesus nhyi eshi mona, okwe ipopile a ti, “Omulumenhu ngu ngeno okwa li omuhunganeki ngeno okuna okukala e shii kutya, omukiinhu ngu e mu piya omulunde.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Opo nee Yesus okwe mu lombwele a ti, “Simoni, ondi na sha nda hala ndi shi ku lombwele.” Simoni okwa yamukula a ti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Mulongi lombwela nge!” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Okwa li kuna omulumenhu umwe a liwa eenguga kaanhu yaali, umwe okwe mu lya eenguga voimaliwa oikukutu oisiliveli omafele yatano, umwe okwe mu lya eenguga voimaliwa omilongo nhano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ayehe yaali oya li ya nyengwa oku vi futa, opo nee, okweya vimina po ayehe yaali. Olye womumba yaali ta kala e mu hole e vule mukwao?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Ndee Simoni okwa yamukula ta ti, “Ondi wete kutya oye ngu a viminwa po eenguga ovindji.” Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Owa pangula mondjila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ndee Yesus okwa pungulukila komukiinhu ndee ta ti kuSimoni, “Ouwete omukiinhu ngu? Onde ya meumbo lyoye, ndele ino pange omeya yokukoha eemhavi vage, ndele ye okwa moteka eemhavi vage nomahovi, ndee te vi puula neehuki vaye. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Oye ino tambulange ko nehupito, ndele omukiinhu ngu ina efa okusimaneka nge nokufipa eemhavi vage nghee nde ya mha. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Oye ino yaeka omutwe wange nomaavi, ndele ye okwa yaeka eemhavi vage noomaavi ya nyika nawa. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Onghee hano andi ku lombwele, ohole oyindji ndji a ulika oya koleka kutya okwa viminwa po eendjo ovidji. Ndee ngu a viminwa po eendjo eeshona, okuna ohole oshona.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ti komukiinhu, “Eendjo voye ova vimwa po.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Mba ya li ye li omutumba oya tameka okupulafana, “Hano oye naana lye ngu, ta vulu nokuvima po eendjo?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ndele nee Yesus okwa ti komukiinhu, “Eitaelo lyoye olye ku hupifa, Inda nombili.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Aakiinhu mba ya enda naYesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Nhyi pwa pita efimbo, Yesus okwa ya, ta ende moilando nomomikunda, ta uvifa Onghundana Oiwa kombiga youhamba waKalunga. Aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali oya ya pamwe nae <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />naakiinhu mba ya li ya yeluvwa keemhepo va kaka nokomauvu yamwe, Malia Mahatalena, ngu muye mwa li mwa tewa eemhepo va kaka heyali, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yohana, omukiinhu waKusa elenga lyaHelodesa, naSusana naakiinhu yamwe mba ya longifa oiniwe yawo mokukwafa Yesus naalongwa yaye.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateusa13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malukusa4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Aanhu oyendji oye ya kuYesus okuza koilando noilando, nanhyi ongudu onene ya ongala, Yesus nokwe ya lombwela eyele,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Omukuni okwa ya a ka kuna eembuto mepya. Mokukuna kwae okwa kuna ta kupula. Eembuto vimwe ova wila mondjila, mu va lyatelwa mo kaanhu neevila ove ya, ndee avi vi shomona po. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Vimwe ova wila poukukutu kapuna evu olindji, ndee mokumena ova nganya, oshonhyi evu lyamho kali na oututo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Vimwe ova yila meehongo, ndee eehongo ova koka ndee avi vifininike. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Vimwe ova wila mevu oliwa, ndee avi koko ndee avi vala lwefele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesus nhyi a mana okupopya, okwa ti kuyo, “Ngu ena omakutwi yokuuva ko, na uve ko!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elalakano lyomaele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Aalongwa yaye oye mu pula kutya eyele ali ti ngeepi, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesus okwa ti, “Nye omwa pewa mu shiwe oiholekwa yOuhamba waKalunga, ndele yamwe otaa lombwelwa momayele, onghee, oku tala ohaa tala, ndele kaye wete ko, nokupwaikina ohaa pwiikine, ndele kaye uviteko.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomukuni ali fatululwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateusa13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malukusa4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Eele ali ti, Ombuto oyo eehapu vaKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Vi va yila mondjila, ova fa aanhu mba haa pwiikine eehapu, ndele Satana ote ya, ndee ta kufa mo eehapu vi va kunwa momitima vawo, opo ya kale ihaa vulu kwiitaela yo ya hupifwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Vi va yila poukukutu, ova fa aanhu mba taa uvu eehapu, ndee taye vi tambula nehafo, ndee ihavi mene omivi muyo. Otaa itaele okafimbo, ndele mefimbo lyomashongo otaa efa po eitaelo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Vi va yila meehongo, ova fa mba taa uvu eehapu, ndele konima yefimbo oimhwiyu nouyamba nouhalu wopauyuni otau fininike eehapu, opo inaya vula okwiimika oiyimati. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Vi va yila mevu oliwa, ova fa aanhu mba taa uvu eehapu, ndee taye vi tambula nomutima omuwa, una evuliko, ndee taa viinine, siyo taa imike oiyimati.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olamba kohi yonhungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Malukusa4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Kaku na omunhu ta teme olamba, ndee te yi tula kohi yonhungwa nenge kohi yombete, ndele okuna kuyi tula koshikwatelwalamba, opo kehe ngu teya meumbo a mone ouyelele.”<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Kehe nhyi sha holekwa ashi ka hololwa, nanhyi sha siikilwa, a shi keya pouyelele.”<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Hano kaleni mwa kotoka nye mu pwiikine. Oshonhyi ngu e na oye ta pewa, ndele ngu kena, ota kufwa noshishonalela nhyi taa vilaavila kutya oku na.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yina naamwainamati yaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateusa12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malukusa3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yina yaYesus naamwayina aalumenhu oye ya ku ye, ndee kaya li taa vulu okufika ku ye omolwouwundji waanhu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Umwe okwa ti kuYesus, “Nyoko naamwanyoko oye li pondje ya hala yeku mone.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo ayehe, “Meme naamwameme oyo mba taa uvu eehapu va Kalunga, ndee taa vulika kuvo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lotifa oshikungulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateusa8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malukusa4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Esiku limwe Yesus okwa londa mowato pamwe naalongwa yaye, ndee ti kuyo, “Tu taulukeni tuyeni kombiga onghwao.” Oya ya. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Mokweenda kwawo Yesus okwa kofa. Okwa tukuluka omhepo onene nowato oyali ya ya omeya, noya li yeli mouviyu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Aalongwa oye ya kuYesus, ndee taye mu pendula ya ti, “Omwene, Omwene, atu sile mo, penduka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesus okwa penduka, ndee ta ngada oshikungulu, nomakufikufi oya mwena, nefuta olya lota. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Eitaelo lyeni oli li peni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Aalongwa oyali ya tila noya kumwa, ndee taa pulafana, “Ngu olye hano, ta ngada omhepo nomakufikufi, ndee otaa vulika kuye?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu e na eemhepo va kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateusa8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malukusa5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesus naalongwa yaye, oya ya koshitopolwa shaGelasene, sha taalelafana naGalilea. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesus nhyi e ya koukukutu, okwa shakenekwa komulumenhu womoshilando mo, e niwe keemhepo va kaka, a ninga efimbo iha zala oikutu, ye iha kala meumbo, ndele okwa kala momakololo yeembila. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ndele nhyi a mona Yesus okwa ingiva mopale, ta wile pohi puye, ndee ta popi mopale, “Yesus Omona waKalunga Wopombadambada! Owa halela nge shi? Andi ku yalikana, ino hepeka nge.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Nhyi okwe shi popya shaanhyi Yesus okwa lombwela omhepo ya kaka yi zemo muye. Efimbo olindji nge yemu hanga, okwa kala ha evililwa, a mangwa nomalyenge neemwiya komaako nokomaulu, ndele oheitokola mo, nomhepo ya kaka ohai mu fala mombuwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesus okwe mu pula, “Ooye lye?” Ye okwa ti, ‘Ose ongudu yaakwaita,’ oshonhyi muye omwa li eemhepo va kaka ovidji. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Eemhepo va kaka ova indila Yesus ine vi undulila moshaasi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Popepi nondudu opwa li oshuunda oshinene shoingulu sha napa. Eemhepo va kaka ova indila Yesus evi tule moingulu. Yesus okwe vi pitika vi ye moingulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Eemhepo va kaka ova zamo momulumenhu nova ya moingulu. Oshuunda ashihe shoingulu osha nhuka okuza komutunhu omuleka, ndele ashi iyumbile mefuta nosha sila mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Aasita yoingulu nhyi ya mona nhyi sha ningwa, oya matuka po, ndele taa ka hokolola oshiningwanima meendoolopa nomomikunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Aanhu oya ya, yaka tale nhyi sha ningwa ko. Oye ya kuYesus noya hanga omulumenhu ngu a li ena eemhepo va kaka e li omutumba puYesus, a zala nawa, ye okuna eenduge, noya li ya tila. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Aanhu mba ye shi mona oya hokololela yakwawo, nghee omulumenhu ngu a li a kwatwa keemheepo va kaka a yeluvwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Nena aanhu ayehe yomomikunda vomuGerasene, oya indila Yesus a ze mo moshilongo shawo, oshonhyi oya li ya tila neenghono. Yesus okwa ya mowato, ndele ta shuna. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Omulumenhu ngu a li ena eemhepo va kaka okwa indila Yesus opo e mu pitike a kale naye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Ndele Yesus okwe mu lekela a ti, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Shuna kolyeni, ndee to ka hokolola nhyi wa ningilwa kuKalunga.” Omulumenhu okwa shuna, ndee ta uvifile ondoolopa ayihe, oilonga oinene mbi Yesus e mu ningila.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omonakavona waJairus nomukiinhu ngu a kuma onguwo yaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateusa9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malukusa5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesus nhyi a yaluka, ayehe oye mu tambula ko, oshonhyi oya hangika yemu teelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ndee omulumenhu wevina Jairus, omukulunhu wOshinagoga, okwe ya kuYesus. Okwa twa eengolo peemhavi vaye, ndee te mu indile aye keumbo lyaye, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />oshonhyi okwa li e na omonakavona, weevula omulongo nambali, e li poku sa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesus mhanga ta yi pamwe naJairus, aanhu oye mu ongakanene. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mokati kao omwa li mu na omukiinhu taaluka ouvu wetiko lyohonde oule weevula omulongo nambali, nonande okwa li a longifa oiniwe yaye ayihe mokukonga epango kaayakuli, kapuna ngu ali a vula oku mu yeluva. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Omukiinhu ngu okwe ya, a zilila Yesus konima ndee te mu kumu komungege woikutu yaYesus. Viyaviya etiko lyohonde olya kanghama. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Opo nee Yesus okwa pula, “Ngu a kuma nge olye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Kehe umwe okwe shi anya, ndee Peetulusa okwa ti, “Mulongi, owa kundukiva kaanhu oyendji.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ndele Yesus okwa ti, “Onde shi vibulula kutya opuna umwe a kuma nge, shaanhyi onda uva mwaame mwa za eenghono.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Hano omukiinhu nhyi a vibulula kutya, okwa vibululwa, okwe ya ndee ta tu eengolo koshipala shaYesus, a tila ta kakama. Okwa lombwela Yesus momeho yaanhu ayehe kutya omolwashike e mu kuma nonghee a yeluka meendelelo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesus okwa ti ku ye, “Mumwange, eitaelo lyoye olye ku yeluva. Inda nombili.” <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Mhanga Yesus ali ta popi, opwe ya omulumenhu a za kolyawo yomukulunhu wOshinangoga a ti, “Omonakavona woe okwa mana eengeda. Oto monifile ali shi Omulongi oihuna?”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ndele Yesus nhyi eshi uvu, okwa ti ku Jairus, “Ino tila, kala una eitaelo, omumwoe ota yeluka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesus nhyi e ya meumbo, ina pitika nande omunhu umwe aye mo pamwe naye kakele kuPeetulusa naYohanesa naYakopo nahe nayina yokaana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Aanhu ayehe mba yali mo oya lila nokuuva oluhovi omolweso lyako. Ndee Yesus okwa ti, “Ina mu lila, oshonhyi okaana inaka sa, oka kofa ike.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Aanhu oya yola Yesus, oshonhyi oyali ye shi shii kutya, okaana oka sa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesus okwe ka kwata moshikaha, ndee ta popi mopale, “Mumwange, penduka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Omhepo yaye oyaaluka, ndee ta fikama viya. Yesus okwe ya lombwela ya pe okaana oikulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Aakulunhu yokaana oya li ya kumwa, ndele Yesus okwe ya kunghulila opo inaa hokololela nande omunhu, nhyi sha ningwa po.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta tumu aalongwa omulongo nayaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateusa10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malukusa6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesus okwa ifana aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali. Okwe ya pa eenghono nepangelo lyokutamo eemhepo va kaka nokuyeluva omikifi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Okwe ya tuma yaye yaka uvifile aanhu kombiga yOuhamba waKalunga nokuyeluva aanauvu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Okwa ti kuyo, “Inamu ya nasha mondjila, handibo, hamhunda yokweenda nayo, haikulya, haimaliwa, haikutu iyali. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nge mwa ya meumbo lyonhumba, ndee omwa tambulwako, kaleni mo siyo amu zamo moshilando nhyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kehe mha amu yi ndee inamu tambulwako, zenimo moshilando nhyo, ndee amu pupula ko ondwi keemhavi veni, shi ninge elondovo kuyo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Aalongwa oya ya, ndee taa ende momikunda avihe, taa uvifa Onghundana Oiwa, ndee taa eluva aanauvu apehe.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helodesa a limbililwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateusa14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malukusa6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Nhyi Helodesa omuleli waGalilea a uva ayihe mbi ya ningwa po, okwa kala a limbililwa, oshonhyi yamwe otaa ti, oYohanesa omushashi a umuka kousi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Yo yamwe otaa ti, oElia a holoka, nayakwawo otaa ti, umwe womaahunganeki a umuka kousi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Helodesa okwa ti, “Yohanesa onde mu tetifa omutwe, ngu oye lye hano? Ondauva omahokololo omendji kombinga yaye.” Helodesa okwa kala ta kongo omhito yokumona Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta kutifa aanhu omaovi yatano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateusa14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malukusa6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohanesa6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Aayapostoli nhyi ya yaluka, oya lombwela Yesus ayihe mbi ya ninga. Yesus okwe ya kufa mo maanhu, ndee tayi nayo kondoolopa yevina Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Aanhu nhyi ye shi uvu, oye mu landulila ko. Okwe ya tambula nehafo, ndee teya hokololele kombiga yOuhamba waKalunga, ndee ta yeluva aanauvu mba yali ya pumbwa okuyeluvwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Nhyi etango lyali li li pokuningina, aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali oye ya kuye, ndee taa ti, “Poima mha omombuwa ike, onghee lekela aanhu ya ye momikunda nomomaumbo yopoushiinda, ya ka konge oikulya nomilele.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Ya peni oikulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Ndele oya tya kuYesus, “Mha otuna po ike eemboloto nhano neehi mbali. Owa hala tuye tuka landele aanhu ayehe mba oikulya?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Aalumenhu mba ya li po oye fike pomayovi yatano. Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye ta ti, “Ningeni aanhu ya kale omutumba meengudu, kehe ongudu naikale ina aanhu omilongo nhano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Oye shi ninga, ya kaleka aanhu ayehe omutumba. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesus okwa kufa eemboloto vo nhano neehi mbali, ndee ta liyamene keulu, ndee te vi yambeke, te vi pambula, ta pe aalongwa yaye ya topolele aanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Aanhu ayehe oya lya, ndee taa kuta. Aalongwa oya toola oihupe youpambu, oimbale omulongo naiyali.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehepululo lyaPeetulusa kombiga yaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mateusa16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Malukusa8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Esiku limwe mhanga Yesus ali ta yalikana oye auke, aalongwa oye ya kuye. Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Aanhu otaa ti aame lye?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Oyemu yamukula ya ti, “Yamwe otaa ti oYohanesa omushashi, yamwe otaa ti o Elia, na yamwe otaa ti umwe womaahunganeki yonale a umuka kousi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesus okwe ya pula natango, “Nye amu ti aame lye?” Peetulusa okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Ooye Kilistus waKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi okuhepekwa kwae nokusa kwae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateusa16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Malukusa8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesus okwe ya indika opo inaye mu popya nando okulye.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesus natango okwa twikilako ta ti, “Omona womunhu ota ka hepekwa nomahepeko omendji, nota ka ekelwahi kaakulunhu, aawiliki yaayambi nokaalongimhango. Otaka vipawa, ndele mesiku etitatu ota umuvwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yesus okwa lombwela aanhu ayehe a ti, “Nge opuna ngu a hala okulandula nge, neivibwe ye mwene, ndee ta hinde omushiyakano wae esiku kehe, opo a landule nge. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Oshonhyi ngu a hala okuhupifa omwenyo wae, ote wu kanifa. Ndele ngu ta kanifa omwenyo wae molwa nge, ote wu hupifa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />A shi kwafa shike mbela, omunhu nande neyi likolele ouyuni auhe, ndele ota kanifa omwenyo wae nenge tei nyono po? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nge opuna omunhu ta si nge ohoni neehapu vage, Omona wOmunhu oteke mu sa ohoni, nhyi teke ya e li meyavimo lyaye mwene nolya He nolyaayengeli aayapuki. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, opuna yamwe yomumba ye li ofika mha, ihaa makele eso mhanga ina ya mona Ouhamba wa Kalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lundululwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateusa17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Malukusa9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Nhyi pwa piti oule woshiike lwaamho konima nhyi Yesus a popya nhyi, Yesus okwa kufa Peetulusa, naYohanesa na Yakopo, ndee ta yi nayo kondudu ya ka yalikana. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Mhanga a li ta yalikana, olupe lwoshipala shaye olwa lundululuka, noikutu yaye oya avima, ya fa ouyelele. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ombaavilila, opwa li aalumenhu yaali taa popi naYesus. Aalumenhu mba oya li oyo Moses naElia. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Oya li ya holoka meyavimo lyomeulu, ndee taa kundafana naYesus nhgee ena okuwanifa ehalo lya Kalunga, nhyi ta ka sa muYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Ndele Peetulusa nayakwawo oya li ye kwetwe keemhosi, ndee nhyi ya papala, oya mona eyavimo lyaYesus naalumenhu yaali ya fikama pu ye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ndee Moses na Elia nhyi ya fiya po Yesus, Peetulusa okwa ti kuye, “Mulongi, mha opouwa nokukala mha. Natu vikeni po omatwali yatatu, limwe olyoe, limwe olya Moses, na limwe olya Elia.” Peetulusa kali eshii nhyi ta popi.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Mhanga a li ta popi natango, opwa holoka oshikoo, ndee tashi ya siikile, naalongwa yaye oya li ya tila unene. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Moshikoo omwa za ewi a li ti, “Ngu Omona wange, nde mu hoolola, mu uveni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Konima yokupopya kwewi, aalongwa oya mona Yesus e li oye auke. Oye shi mwenena, yo inaa hokololela nande oumwe pefimbo ndyo ashihe nhyi ya mona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omumati a kwatwa ko keemhepo va kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateusa17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Malukusa9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Mesiku lya landula, Yesus naalongwa yaye yatatu nhyi ya londoloka kondudu, okwa shakenekwa kongudu onene yaanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Omulumenhu umwe womongudu okwa ingiva mopale a ti, “Mulongi! Andi ku indile, tala omumwange, ewifa lyange! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Omhepo ya kaka ohai mu ponokele, ta tameke ta kuu, ta yi mu pundaula, yo ta yi mu etifa onhutu kokanya, yo inayi hala oku mu efa! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Onda li nda indila aalongwa yoe yeyi temo, ndele inaa pondola sha.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesus okwa yamukula a ti, “Oihuna oifike peni kepipi lyonganhyi kali na eitaelo lyo olya pilalala, siyo onaini andi kala punye noku mu ivivimikila?” Ndee Yesus okwa ti komulumenhu, “Omumwoe mu eta nghu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mhanga okaana taka etwa ku Yesus, omhepo oye ka mbugaambuga, ndele ta yi ka hata pevu. Yesus okwa ngada omhepo ya kaka nokwa yeluva omumati, ndele te mu fala kuhe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Aanhu ayehe oya kuminwa eenghono eenene va Kalunga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesus ta popi natango okusa kwae</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateusa17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malukusa9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Aanhu ayehe oya kala natango ya kuminwa oinenelonga mbi a longa ayihe, nhyi a lombwela aalongwa yaye ta ti, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Pwiikineni nawa kunhyi ndili poku mulombwele, nye mu vi viinine! Omona wOmunhu ota ka yandjwa moikaha yaanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Aalongwa ina ya uva ko kutya, okwa hala kutya ngeepi oshonhyi osha li sheya holekwa, noya tila oku mu pula yasho.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olye omunene?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateusa18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malukusa9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Mokati kaalongwa omwa penduka evilaavilo kutya, olye omunene e vule yakwawo ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesus nhyi a vibulula omavilaavilo yomitima vawo, okwa kufa okaana, ndele te ka fikameke ponho yaye, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ndee ta ti ku yo: “Kehe ngu ta tambula ko okaana ngha mevina lyange, ye ota tambula nge; na ngu ta tambula nge, ye ota tambula ngu a tuma nge. Oshonhyi ngu omuvinwa kwaayehe mokati keni, oye omunene.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngu keli omhinge nanye okwa ama kunye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Malukusa9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohanesa okwa popya a ti, “Mulongi, otwa mona omunhu umwe ta temo eemhepo va kaka mevina lyoye, ndele otwe mu indika oshonhyi ye keshi womongudu yetu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ndele Yesus okwa ti kuye nokaalongwa aakwao: “Inamu mu indika, oshonhyi nge ke li omhinge nanye, ye okwa ama kunye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aanhu yomomukunda womuSamalia ya anya okutambula Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Hano efimbo lya Yesus lyokulonda a ye meulu nhyi lya fika, okwa tokola opo a ye kuYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Okwa tetekelifa aatumwa yaye, ya ye komukunda womuSamaria, opo yeke mu longekivile oinima ayihe. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ndele ina tambulwa ko, oshonhyi oshali shayela kutya Yesus okwa li a uka kuYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Hano aalongwa yaye Yakopo na Yohanesa, nhyi ye shi mona, oya ti, “Omwene, owa hala tu indile omundilo u ze meulu, uya halakanife po?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesus okwe ya tala, ndee te ya ngada. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ndee Yesus naalongwa oya ya komukunda umwe.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mba ya hala okulandula Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateusa8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Molweendo lwawo, omulumenhu umwe okwa ti ku Yesus, “Andi ku landula kehe mha to yi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Eembadje ovi na omitutu, neevila vaulu ovi na oihavi, ndele Omona wOmunhu ke na mha ha nangala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesus okwa lombwela umwe a ti, “Landula nge!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ndele omulumenhu ngu okwa ti, “Omwene, pitika nge manga ndi ka fundike tate.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Efa aasi ya fundike aasi yawo. Inda, uka uvife Ouhamba waKalunga.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Umwe natango okwa ti ku Yesus, “Omwene, ondahala oku ku landula, ndele efa ne mhanga ndi ka lekele yambilyetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Kehe ngu ta pulula, ndele ota tala konima, ina opalela Ouhamba waKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 10</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta tumu aalongwa omilongo heyali nayaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Konima yambi, Omwene okwa hoolola aalongwa omilongo heyali nayaali nokwe ya tumu moyaali, ye mu tetekele kondoolopa nokehala kehe e na okuya ko. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Okwe ya lombwele a ti, “Oilya oyi li po oyindji, ndele aalongi aashona. Yalikaneni hano mwene woilya, a tume aalongi keteyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Indeni! Andi mu tumu ongeezi mokati komambugu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Inamu hinda okamhunda koimaliwa nenge omhunda yokweenda nayo, hanghaku, nye inamu fikamena aanhu meendjila muya kunde. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Nge amu yi meumbo lyonhumba, tango tyeni, ‘Ombili nai kale meumbo ndi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nge omu na omunhu e hole ombili, nena ekundo lyeni lyombili ali kala naye, ndele nge hasho, ombili yeni otayi mu yalukile. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Kaleni meumbo olyo tuu ndyo, lyeni nokumwa kehe nhyi tamu pewa, oshonhyi omulongi kehe okuna okupewa ondjabi yaye. Inamu za meumbo limwe muye kulikwawo. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Nge amu yi moshilando shonhumba ndele amu tambulwa ko, lyeni nhyi amu pewa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Yeluveni aanauvu mondoolopa mo, nye amu ya lombwele kutya Ouhamba waKalunga oweya popepi nayo. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Nge amu yi moshilando ndele inamu tambulwa ko, indeni momapandaada yasho ndee amu ti, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />ondwi yomoshilando sheni ndji ya kanyatele keemhavi vetu, atu yi pupula ko, opo yi ninge elondovo kunye. Ndele kaleni mu shi shii kutya Ouhamba waKalunga ouli popepi nanye. <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Onghee andi mu lombwele, Sodom ashika kala oshihwepo shi vule oshilando nhyo, mesiku lyepangulo!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oilando inayi itevulula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateusa11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Oihuna oyi fike peni kwooye Korasin! Oihuna oyi fike peni kwooye Betsaida! Ngeno muTilus nomuSidon mwa ningilwe oikumwifalonga mbi ya ningilwa munye, ngeno oye itevulula nale, taa zala omahahi nokukala omutumba momutoko ya ulike kutya oye itevulula. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ndele Tilus naSidon otayi ka kala oihwepo esiku lyepangulo kunye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nooye Kapelenaum, oto ka tumbala tuu siyo omeulu? Ahawe, oto ka umbilwa moheli!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Kehe ngu ta vulika keehapu veni, ota vulika keehapu vage. Nakehe ngu ihe mu tambula, iha tambula nge; na ngu iha tambula nge, iha tambula ngu a tuma nge.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okwaaluka kwaalongwa omilongo heyali nayaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Aalongwa omilongo heyali nayaali oyaaluka nehafo enene, noya ti, “Omwene, neemhepo va kaka nhyi twe vi ngada mevina lyoye, ova vulika kuse.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Ondamona Satana a wa meulu ongolwaavi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Taleni, onde mu pa epangelo neenghono, vokulyata omayoka neendje, nokusinda eenghono avihe vomutondi, ko kakunaali nhyi ashi mu etele oshiponga. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ndele inamu hafa molwanhyi eemhepo va kaka avi vulika kunye; ndele hafeni nge omavina yeni ya shangwa membo lyomeulu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehafo lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateusa11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Pefimbo mho, Jessus okwa li a uvifwa ehafo kOmhepo Ondjapuki ndee ta ti, “Tate, Omwene weulu nowevu! Andi ku hambelele, shaanhyi oinima mbi oweyi holeka aanongo naananduge, ndele owei hololela mba ya fa ounona. Eeno Tate, nhyi osho wa hala shi kale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tate okwa pa nge oinima ayihe. Kaku na ngu a shiwa Omona, kakele kuTate, ko kaku na ngu a shiwa Tate, kakele kOmona namba Omona a hoolola oku ye mu hololela.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yesus okwa tala kuyo ndele ta ti, “Onye aanelao mba amu mono ayihe mbi mweyi tala! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Oshonhyi andi mu lombwele kutya, eehamba naahunganeki oyendji oya li ya hala ya mone mbi amu tala, ndele inaye yi tala, nokuuva mbi amu uvu, ndele inaye yi uva.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyOmusamalia omunamutimanghenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ndee omulongimhango umwe okwe ya a makele Yesus ta ti, “Mulongi, ondi na okuninga shi opo ndi mone omwenyo waaluhe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Momhango omwa shangwa kwati ngeepi? Owii uviteko ngeepi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Okwa yamukula a ti, “Hola Omwene Kalunga koye nomutima woe auhe nomwenyo woe auhe nomavilaavilo yoe ayehe neenghono voye avihe’, oye Hola mukweni nganhyi wu ihole mwene.’” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Owa yamukula mondjila, shi wanifa ndee to kala nomwenyo.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ndele omulongimhango nhyi a li a hala okwiimonikifa omuyuuki, okwa pula Yesus natango a ti, “Mukwetu olye?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula, “Okwa li ku na omulumenhu wonhumba a za kuJerusalem ta yi kuYeriko nokwa hangika keembuvi. Ove mu vula oikutu noku mu vega, ndee avi mu fii nokamwenyo okashona. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Mondjila ndjo omwa hangika amu ende omuyambi. Nhyi e mu mona, okwa kanduka mo mondjila, ndele te mu pitilile. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Nomulevi naye nhyi e mu mona, okwa kanduka mo mondjila ndele temu pitilile. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ndele mhanga Omusamaria a li ta ende mondjila ndjo, okwe ya pomulumenhu ngu, nanhyi e mu mona, omutima wae owa li wa uva olukeno. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Okwa heena puye, ndele ta panga oipute yaye nomaavi nomaviinyu, ndee te yi manga. Okwe mu londeka kondoogi, ndee temu fala konduda yaayenda ndee temu tonatele. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Esiku lya landulako, okwa kufa eedenari mbali, ndee tevi pe mwene weumbo lyaayenda ta ti, ‘Mu tonatela, ndee nge eedenari mbali ina vi wana, andiya ndiku yalulile ashihe nhyi wa longifa muye.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesus okwa hulifa a ti, “Pamavilaavilo yoe, upi mumba yatatu a li mukwawo wangu a hangikilwe keembuvi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Omulongimhango okwa yamukula a ti, “Oye ngu e mu sila onghenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesus okwa ti, “Nooye inda hano u ka ninge shafaafana nanhyi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta talele po Maalita naMalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Molweendo lwaYesus naalongwa yaye, oya ya momukunda umwe, nomukiinhu wevina Maalita okwe mu tambula meumbo lyaye. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Maalita okwa li e na mumwaina Malia, ngu a li a panda okukala omutumba peemhavi vOmwene, ta pwiikine nhyi Yesus a li ta longo. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Maalita mokukala ta viyauka unene noilonga yokuyakula, okwa li euvite nai nokwe ya ku Yesus ta ti, “Omwene, ku na ko nasha naame, mumwameme nhyi a efa ndi longe oilonga ayihe aame auke? Mu lombwela euye a kwafele nge.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Omwene okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Maalita, Maalita, owe ipyakivila noinima oyindji, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ndele shimwe ashike shapumbiwa. Malia okwa hoolola ombiga oiwa noiheyi kufwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 11</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta longo okuyalikana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateusa6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Esiku limwe Yesus okwa li ta yalikana pehala lyonhumba. Nhyi a mana, umwe womaalongwa yaye okwa ti kuye, “Omwene, tulonga okuyalika nganhyi Yohanesa a longa aalongwa yaye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nge amu yalikana tyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">evina lyoye eyapuki na li yapulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ouhamba woe nawu uye. Ehalo lyoye nali wanifwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tu pa okulya kwetu kwesiku kehe.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Tu vimina po eendjo vetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">nganhyi nase atu vimine po mba ya nyona kuse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Ino tu fala momashongo.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye, “Olye womunye e na kaume kaye, nge teuya kuye mokati kousiku ta ti, ‘Kaume kange, penge eemboloto nhatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />shaanhyi kaume kange eya po, ndee kandina sha shokumu pa a lye.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Natu tye ngeno, kaume koye ngo ote ku yamukula e li meni ta ti, ‘Ino piyaaneka nge, omweelo owa pata nale, naamwange oya nangala pwaame. Ihandi vulu okupenduka ndi ku pe sha.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Andi mu lombwele, nge iha penduka, e ku pe eemboloto molwoukaume weni naye, oku na oku penduka e ku pe molwanhyi ino sholola okumwiindila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Onghee andi mu lombwele, Indileni, ndele ta mu pewa; kongeni ndele ta mu mono; kongholeni nomweelo otau yeululwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Oshonhyi kehe ngu ta indile ota pewa; nangu ta kongo ota mono; nangu ta konghola omweelo otaumu yeululilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Omuvali olye womokati keni, nge omona nge te mu indile ohi, ote mu pe eyoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nenge nge te mu indile eyi, ote mu pe ondje? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Hano nge nye mba mwaayi, ngeege omu shi ku pa oyana yeni oipewa oiwa, unene tuu Ho yeni womeulu, otaka yandja Omhepo Ondjapuki kumba taye mu indile.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus naBelsebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateusa12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Malukusa3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesus okwa tamo omhepo ya kaka ya li ya fitika omulumenhu ondaka, ndee omhepo ya kaka nhyi ya za mo, omulumenhu omufitandaka okwa popya, nongudu yaanhu oya kumwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Yamwe yomuyo oya ti, “OBelsebul, omukulunhu weemhepo va kaka e mu pa eenghono voku tamo eemhepo va kaka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Yamwe natango oye mu shonga noye mu pula, e ya ulikile eviviliko lyoku ulika kutya ota longifwa ku Kalunga komeulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ndele Yesus nhyi a vibulula omavilaavilo yawo, okwa ti kuyo:, “Ka ku na ouhamba tawu vulu kwiilwifa muwowene shaanhyi otau hanauka po, ko kakuna eumbo ta li itopola mulyolyene, ota li hanauka po. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Hano nge Satana ote ilwifa ye mwene, ouhamba wae awu vulu okukala po ngeepi? Onda popya nhyi molwanhyi amu ti eenghono voku tamo eemhepo va kaka onde vi pewa ku Belsebul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nge nani ohandi temo eemhepo va kaka oha ndi longifwa kuBelsebul, yo oyana yeni otaye vi temo neenghono valye? Onghee hano ota ningi aapanguli yeni. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ndele nge eemhepo va kaka andi vi temo neenghono vaKalunga, Ouhamba wa Kalunga oweya punye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Nge omulumenhu omunanghono, e na oilwifo ya wana ta pahukile eumbo lyaye, eliko lyaye olya amenwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ndele nge ta ponokelwa kuumwe ena eenghono e mu vule, ota sindwa ndele ta kufwa oilwifo yaye mbi a li eyi ineekela, ndee tei topolele po aanhu ooyakwawo.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ngu ke li pamwe naame oku na ondubo naame, nangu iha ongele pamwe naame ota hanauna po.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyaluka kwomhepo ya kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateusa12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Nge omhepo ya kaka ta yi zi momunhu, otayi pumhauka moukukutu, ta yi kongo ehala lyoku vululukwa, ndele nge ina yi mona, otayi ti, ‘Andi shuna meumbo lyange mu nda zile.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nanhyi ta yiimo, otayi hanga mwa yela nawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ota yii nee, ndee ta yi ka konga eemhepo va kaka eenghwao heyali viivule mouyinai. Ota vuuya ndee tavi kala mo, nokukala kwomunhu ngo ota ku ningi okuyinai ku vule kwopetameko.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehafo lyoshili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Mhanga a li ta popi nhyi, omukiinhu umwe mongudu yaanhu okwa ingiva ndee ta ti kuye, “Omukiinhu e ku vala ndee te ku nyamifa oye omunelao!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ndele Yesus okwa yamukula ta ti, “Eeno, ndele aanelao oyo mba taa uvu ohapu ya Kalunga ndee ta vulika kuyo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aanhu ya hala oshikumwifalonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateusa12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Aanhu nhyi yemu ngudumanene, Yesus okwe ya lombwela ta ti, “Aanhu yopefimbo mha aayi. Oya hala oshikumwifaviviliko ndele ihaa pewa nande oshimwe kakele kunhyi shaJona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Oshonhyi nganhyi omuhunganeki Jona a li eviviliko kAaninive, osho nghaa Omona womunhu ta kala eviviliko kepipi lyonganhyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Omukiinhu ohamba yokoumbuwanhu ota ka holoka mesiku lyepangulo, note ke mu pa ousama, oshonhyi ye okwa zile keeha vouyuni, a pwiikine eenduge va Salomo; ndele ngu e li mha okuvule Salomo. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Aaninive otaa ka holoka pamwe nanye mesiku lyepangulo, notaye ke mu pa ombevi, oshonhyi yo oye itevululifwa keuvifo lya Jona; ndele ngu e li mha okuvule Jona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ouyelele wolutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateusa5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kaku na omunhu ta tema olamba ndee te yi tula kohi yoshimbale nenge teyi holeke, ndele ote yi tula koshikwatelwalamba, opo kehe ngu teya mo, a mone ouyelele. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Omeho yeni oyo olamba yolutu. Omeho yoe nge omandjolowele, nena olutu lwoe aluhe olu na ouyelele, ndele nge omeho yoe kaye na oundjolowele, olutu lwoe aluhe olwa uva omilaulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Kotoka hano ouyelele mbu uli mwooye uha ninge omilaulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nge olutu lwoe olu na ouyele, no kalu na nande ombiga yimwe i li momilaulu, nena olutu aluhe ota lu yandja ouyelele ongolamba yeku minikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yandja ombevi kAafalisai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateusa23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malukusa12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesus nhyi a mana oku popya, omufarisai umwe okwe mu pula a kalye pamwe naye, Yesus okwa ya ndee ta kala omutumba a lye. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Omufarisai okwa li a kumwa nhyi a mona Yesus ta li ine ikoha keenyala. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ndele Omwene okwe mu lombwele ta ti, “Nye Aafalisai, ndishi ohamu koho oiyaha nomakopi kombada, ndele nye yene meni lyeni omwa uva onyanya nouyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Malayi nye! Kalunga ngu a shita kombada, haye nghaa a shita meni? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yandjeni keehepele nhyi shili momakopi yeni, naayihe otayi kala ya kohoka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Oihuna kunye Aafalisai! Ohamu yandja kuKalunga oshitimulongo shoimbodi kaina oshilonga, ominta, noiziba, ndele ohamu vini ouyuuki nohole yaKalunga.” Ayihe mbi omu na okwiininga, ndele ina vina ouyuuki nohole yaKalunga.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Oihuna kunye Aafalisai! Oshonhyi omu hole okukala omutumba koipundi yokomeho meeshinagoga nokukundilwa pomahala yomalandifilo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Oihuna nye! Shaanhyi omwa fa eembila kavi na omaviviliko, naanhu otaa ende kombada yavo ndele kaye shi shii.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Umwe womaalongimhango okwa ti ku Yesus: “Mulongi, omapopyo yoe otaye tu sifa ohoni.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Oihuna, nokunye aalongimhango! Oshonhyi ohamu twike omitengi omiviyu komapepe yaanhu, omhanga nye yene ihamu kumu ko nande onomunwe umwe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Oihuna! Oshonhyi ohamu tungu eembila vaahunganeki, yo oohokulu ye ya vipaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Hano nye omu na oumbagi nomwa itaela nhyi oohokulu ya ninga; oya vipaa aahunganeki ndee nye otamu ya tungile eembila. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Onghee hano ounongo wa Kalunga otawu ti, ‘Andi ya tumine aahunganeki naatumwa. Yamwe yomuyo otaye ya vipaa, nayamwe otaye ya monifa oihuna.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Onghee hano aanhu yopefimbo ndi, otaa ka handukilwa molwomavipao yaahunganeki oku za petameko lyouyuni. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Oku za nghaa kevipao lyaAbel fiyo okevipao lyaSakalia, ngu a vipaelwa pokati koaltali nehala eyapuki. Eeno, andi mu lombwele, aanhu yopefimbo ndi oye na ku handukilwa molwomavipao ngo.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Oihuna, nye aalongimhango! Nhyi mwa kufa ko oshapi younongo, nye yene inamu yamo, ndele namba ya hala ku ya mo omwe ya keelela mo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesus nhyi a fiya po ehala ndyo, aalongimhango nAafalisai oya tameka oku mu sheka noku mu pula omapulo kombiga yoinima oyindji. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Oya li hala okutala nge ota yemu mono ousama.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 12</para>
  <para style="s">Kotokeleni aanaineya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateusa10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Aanhu omayovi nomaovi oya ongala noya li ya finana, taa lyatafana. Yesus okwa tameke tango okupopya naalongwa yaye ta ti, “Kotokeleni omalongo kaena oushili yAafalisai, shaanhyi mbo owo omukalo wao wokupukifa aanhu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kapu na shimwe sha siikilwa ashi ka kala ina shi suukulwa, no kapu na oshiholekwa ihashi ka kala inashi shiikwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kehe nghaa nhyi mwa popya momilaulu, ashi ka uvikwa mouyelele. Nanhyi mwa nyongofolela aanhu meholeko meenduda va ivilwa, ashi ka ingivwa kuza kombada yeenduda.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olye ena okutilika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateusa10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ookaume kange, andi mu lombwele, inamu tila mba taa vipaa olutu, ndele ihaa vulu ali ku ninga sha shimwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Andi mu ulikile ngu e na okutilika; tileni Kalunga ngu ena eenghono nepangelo vokuvipaa nokuundulila moheli. Eeno, mu tileni.” <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Hamba oonamusheshe yatano ihaa landwa nomapeni yaali? Ndele natango Kalunga ina vibwa nande umwe womuyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Neehuki veni vokomutwe ova yalulwa avihe. Inamu tila, nye omuna ongushu mu vule oonamusheshe oyendji.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okutambula nokwaanya Kilistus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mateusa10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Andi mu kwashilipaleke, kehe ngu ta tambula nge momeho yaanhu, nOmona wOmunhu ote ke mu tambula momeho yaayengeli yaKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ndele kehe ngu te ivibike nge moipafi yaanhu, nOmona wOmunhu oteke mu ivibika monhaneho yaayengeli yaKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ngu ta popi eli omhinge nOmona wOmunhu ota viminwapo, ndele ngu ta sheke Omhepo Ondjapuki iha viminwa po. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Nge amu falwa meeshinagoga nenge koipala yomalenga noyeehamba noyaapangeli, inamu kala muna oshimhwiyu kutya, amu ka popya shi. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Oshonhyi Omhepo Ondjapuki otayi mu longo nhyi mu na okutya pefimbo opo tuu mho.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomuyamba elayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Wumwe womongudu yaanhu okwa ti kuYesus, “Mulongi, lombwela mumwameme omukulunhu, tu topolelafane naye oufiye weliko lyatate.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Kaume kange, olye a ufa nge ndi ninge omupanguli woufiye weni?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Hangaleni nye mu kotokele ouhalu kehe, oshonhyi okukalamwenyo kwoshili komunhu inaku ningwapo keliko lyaye.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesus okwe ya lombwele eyele a ti, “Epya lyomuyamba wonhumba olya vala nawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Omuyamba okwa vilaavila nhyi, “Kandina mha a ndi siikilile oilikolomwa yange. Andi ningi ngeepi? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Andi ningi ngaanhyi. Andi hanauna po omaanda yange, ndele andi tungu po yamwe omanene, mu andi ka siikilila mo oilya noilikolomwa yange ayihe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Nena andi lombwele omwenyo wange kutya, Munelao oye! Owa siikilililwa ashihe nhyi wapumbwa mefimbo lyeevula ovidji komeho. Onghee fuva, ndee to li ndee to mu, ndee toihafifa!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ndele Kalunga okwa ti kuye, “Shilayi oye! Ousiku mbu wonena, omwenyo woe oto wu kufwa; nganhyi oinima ayihe mbi we ilikolela otai ningi yalye?’<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Nhyi osho ashi ka ningilwa kehe ngu te ikongele omaliko, ye keshi omuyamba koshipala shaKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inekela muKalunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateusa6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye, “Onghee andi mu lombwele, inamu kala mu na oshimhwiyu kutya amu li shi opo mu kale muna omwenyo, nenge oshimhwiyu sholutu kutya amu zala shi. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Oshonhyi okukala nomwenyo oku vule oikulya, nolutu oluvule omizalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Taleni omakola, ihaa kunu yo ihaa teya, yo kaye na eenduda vokusiikilila nenge omaanda, ndee Kalunga ohe ya palufa. Ndele nye omuna ongushu mu vule eevila. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Olye womunye ta vulu okuweva ko nande owili imwe konghalamwenyo yaye noshiho shaye? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nonge nani ihamu vulu okuninga oshiima oshishona nganhyi nhyi, omolwashike mu na okukala mwa sa oshiho shoinima yimwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Taleni nye vivilikeni nghee eengala vomoihwa havi koko. Ihavi longo vo ihavi iningile omizalo. Ndele andi mu lombwele, naSalomo moukengeli wae ina zala a fe nande yimwe yomuvo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Hano Kalunga nge ota zike omwiivi, mbu u li po ike nena, ndele mongula awu umbilwa meziko. Kalunga iheke mu sila oshiho shi vulife eengala? Yanhu nye yeitaelo eshona! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Inamu kala muna oimhwiyu kutya amu li shi nenge amu mu shi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Shaanhyi mba inaa shiwa Kalunga oyo haa kala yena oimhwiyu mbi. Ndele nye, Kalunga keni okushi shii kutya omwei pumbwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ndele komeho lyaayihe mbi, kongeni tango Ouhamba waKalunga, naKalunga ote ke mu pa ayihe mwe yi pumbwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliko meulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateusa6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Inamu tila, okangudu okashona nye! Oshonhyi Ho weni okwa hala oku mu pa Ouhamba. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Landifeni po omaliko yeni, ndee oimaliwa amu yi pe eehepele. Ilikoleleni oumhunda woimaliwa mbu ihau kulupa. Punguleni eliko lyeni meulu, mu ihamu yi eembuvi, neenyiki ihavi vulu oku li nyona po. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Oshonhyi nghu kuna eliko lyoye, oko ku na omutima woe.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleni oupafi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Kaleni mwe ilongekivila oilonga, neelamba veni va tema, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />onga aanhu ya teelela mwene wao ta zi koshitufi shohango. Nge eya ndee ta konghola, otaa vulu oku mu yeulula meendelelo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Aanelao aapiya mba, mwene wao nge teya, ota hanga ye li opafi. Oshili andi mu lombwele, ota vula mo ondjafa yaye, ndee te ya yakula. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Yo aanelao ngeepi, nge teya hanga ye li oupafi nande neuye mokati kousiku nenge keengulasha. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />“Ndele shi shiweni, mwene weumbo ngeno nge okushii efimbo ombuvi tai ya okuyaka, ngeno iha efa eumbo lyaye li tewe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nanye kaleni mwe ilongekiva, shaanhyi Omona wOmunhu oteya efimbo inamu mu teelela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omupiya omuviinini nangu keshi omuuviinini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateusa24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Peetulusa okwa ti “Omwene, eyele ndi ose to li lombwele nenge aanhu ayehe?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Omwene okwa yamukula, “Olye hano omupiya omuviinini nomunanduge? Oye ngu mwene wae te mu pe oshilonga shokutonatela eumbo lyaye, ye ta pe aapiya ooyakwawo oikulya pefimbo lyao. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Omunelao omupiya ngu mwene wae nge te ya, temu hanga ta ningi ngaanhyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Oshili, andi mu lombwele, mwene wae otemu pe a tonatele oinima yaye ayihe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ndele omupiya ngo nge ote ilombwele ye mwene momutima ta ti, ‘Mwene wange ihe ya viya, ndee ta tameke okuvega aapiya yakwawo aalumenhu naakiinhu ndele ta li, ndele ta mu, ndele ta kolwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mwene womupiya ngu, ote ya esiku ndi ine mu teelela nefimbo ndi ina shiwa. Mwene ote mu handukila, pamwe noonakuhavulika yakwao.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Ndele omupiya ngu eshii nhyi mwene wae a hala a ninge ndele ineshi ninga, otaka handukilwa unene. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ndele omupiya ngu ina shiwa nhyi mwene wae a hala, ndee ta ningi epuko, ota vegwa kashona. Oshonhyi kehe ngu a pewa oshindji, ota ka pulwa oshindji; nangu a pewa oshindji unene, ota ka pulwa oshindji unene.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus omweetifi wetopoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateusa10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Ame onde ya okutema omundilo kombada yevu, nonda hala nokuhalelela ngeno owa hwama nale. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Onda teelela eshasho lyemono lyoihuna, onghee onduuvite ouviyu siyo ali wanifwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Amu vilaavila kutya onda eta ombili kombada yevu? Ahawe, kaishi ombili, ndele etopoko. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Okuza mha, aanhu yatano yomeumbo limwe otaa ka topoka ngaanhyi; yatatu otaa twilafana ondubo nayaali, nayaali otaa ka twilafana ondubo nayatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Oyanamati otaa ka kala yeli omhinge noohe, noohe otaa ka kala omhinge noyanamati. Oyanakavona otaa ka kala yeli omhinge nooyina, nooyina otaa ka kala yeli noyanakavona. Oshitenya shomukiinhu ashi ka kala shili omhinge nayinamweno, nayinamweno otaka kala eli omhinge noshitenya shaye.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuuvako efimbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2">Mateusa16:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesus okwa ti kongudu yaanhu, “Nge mu wete oikoo tayi zi mouninginino, ohamu ti aku lokwa, ndee osho ashi ningwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nge omhepo tayi zi koumbuwanhu a mu ti, aku zi oluteni, sho osho ashi ningwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Aanaineya nye! Omushii okutala kevu nokewangandjo okutengeneka onghalo yomhepo, ndele kamu shii ku vivilika efimbo ndi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvafaneni kumwe naatamaneki yeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateusa5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Omolwashi ihamu i pangula nye yene pauyuuki? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nge opu na ngu teku fala komhangu, kambavala wu pukulule epuko lyoye mhanga ina mu fika komhangu, opo ineku yandja nefiminiko komupanguli, omupanguli e ku yandje komumbala, omumbala te ku evilile movologo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Andi ku lombwele, ku na mha to yi mhanga ino mana okufuta okapeni kahwiinina kehandukilo lyoye.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 13</para>
  <para style="s">Eitevululo nenge eso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Pefimbo ndyo, opwa li pu na aanhu mba ya hokololela Yesus kombiga yaAgalilea mba ya vipawa kuPilatus mhanga ya li taa yandja omayambo motembeli. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Amu viilavila kutya, molwanhyi Aagalilea ya vipawa momukalo mbu, oya li aalunde unene ye vule Yakwao? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ahawe, andi mu lombwele, nge inamu itevulula komaulunde yeni, osho nanye amu ka sa nganhyi yo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Nenge amu ti omulongo nayahetatu yenya ya sa nhyi ya wilwa koshungo yomuSiloa oya li aalunde ye vule aanhu ayehe yomuYelusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ahawe. Andi mu lombwele, nanye nge ihamu itevulula, amu ka hanauka po amuhe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomukwiyu inawu ima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ndee Yesus okwe ya lombwela eyele ndi,” Okwa li ku na omunhu e na omukwiyu wa twikwa mepya lyomiviinyu, ndee teuya a konge mo oiyimati muwo, ndele ina mona mo sha. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Okwa lombwela omulongi wepya lyomiviinyu, “Tala, ‘Oule weevula nhatu onda kala andiya kukonga mo oiyimati momukwiyu mu, ndele inandi mona mo sha. Uka po. Omolwashike wu na okumana evu eenghono kauwalala? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ndele omulongi okwa yamukula, “mwene, wu efa natango ovula yimwe, mhanga andi fe oshilambo shewu vigilila, ndee andi wu tutile ouhoho. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Onawa nge awu ka ima oiyimati movula yalandula, ndele nge ina wu ima, nau kewe po.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omukiinhu oshilema mesiku lyeSabati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Esiku lyeSabati Yesus okwa li ta longo aanhu mOshinangoga. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Omwa li mu na omukiinhu e niwe komhepo ya kaka, ndji ye mu etela ouvu eevula omulongo nahetatu. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Nhyi Yesus e mu mona, okwa ti kuye, “Mukiinhu, owaeluka kouvu woe!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesus okwa tenheke omake yaye kombada yomukiinhu, viyaviya omukiinhu okwa fikama, ndee ta tameke okuhambelela Kalunga.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ndele omukulunhu wOshinangoga okwa tameke okuhandukila Yesus molwanhyi a yeluva mesiku lyesabati nokwa lombwela aanhu ta ti, “Oku na omasiku yahamano yoilonga, ileni hano momasiku ngo muyeluvwe, ndele kaishi mesabati.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ndele Omwene okwe mu yamukula ta ti, “Munaineya oye! Ihamu pitifa mo ongobe ile ondoogi moshuunda mesiku lyEsabati, ndele amu keyi hwiila? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ndee mha opu na omutekulu wAbeleham, ngu Satana a tula mouvu oule weevula omulongo nahetatu, ndele iha mangululwa ngeno mesiku lyEsabati?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Hano Yesus nhyi a popya nhyi, aatondi yaye ayehe oya si ohoni, ndee aanhu yakwawo ayehe oya hafele oilonga oikumifi e yi longa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomuma oshona lela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateusa13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malukusa4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesus okwa ti, “Ouhamba waKalunga owa fa shi? Andi wu yeleke nashi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Owa fa omuma oshona lela, Omulumenhu e yi kufa, ndee te yi kunu mepya lyaye. Oya koka, ndee tayi ningi omuti, neevila ova tungilamo oihavila moitayi yawo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 13:19">Eele lyefulika</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 13:19">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateusa13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:19">20 Natango Yesus okwa pula, “Ouhamba waKalunga andi wu yeleke nashi? <verse eid="LUK 13:19" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Owa fa efulika, omukiinhu e li kufa, ndele te li pilulile mousila oimbale itatu, nde nande nee efulika olya li eshona lela, ousila auhe owa li wa fula.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osheelo sha finana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mateusa7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21:23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesus okwa enda moilando nomomikunda, ta longo aanhu, nhyi a li mondjila yaye yokuya kuYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Wumwe okwe mu pula, “Omwene, aanhu mba taa ka hupifwa aashona ike?” Yesus okwa ti kuyo, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Kondjeni, mu ye mo mosheelo sha finana, sha uka mOuhamba waKalunga, oshonhyi andi mu lombwele, oyendji otaa kambavala okuya mo, ndele otaa ka nyengwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Mwene weumbo nge okwa penduka, ndee ta ivile omweelo weumbo, nena amu fikama pondje, ndee amu konghola pomweelo amu ti, ‘Mwene tu yeulula!’ Ndele ye otemu yamukula ta ti, ‘Kandi shii mha amu zi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ndee nye amu ka tya, ‘Se otwa lya nokunwa pamwe nooye, nowa longa aanhu mondoolopa shetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ndele ye oteke mu lombwela ta ti, ‘Kandi shii mha amu zi, zeni po pwaame aakolokohi nye!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Ndee aku ka kala elilaano neikokoto lyomayoo, nhyi amu ka mona Abeleham naIsak naYakopo naahunganeki ayehe mOuhamba wa Kalunga, mhanga nye mwa undulilwa pondje. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ndee aanhu otaa ka za keembiga avihe vouyuni ndee taa ka kala omutumba mOuhamba waKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ndee aahwiinini otaa ka ninga aatango, naatango otaa ka ninga aahwiinini.<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lili molwa Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateusa23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Pefimbo olyo tuu ndyo, yamwe yomAafalisai oye ya, ndele taa ti kuye, “Fikama, zapo mha, oshonhyi Helodesa okwa hala oku ku vipaa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Indeni mu ka lombwele kaandje ngo, amu ti, ‘Tala, nena nomongula andi temo eemhepo va kaka nokuyeluva, ndee esiku etitatu andi ka mana oilonga yange. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ndele nande ongaanhyo, ondina ku twikila nondjila yange nena, mongula nomongheleinya. Oshonhyi omuhunganeki iha vipaelwa pamwe, ndele omuYelusalema.”<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalema, Yelusalema, oye ngu ho vipaa aahunganeki noho vipaa nomamanya mba wa tuminwa. Lungapi nda li nda hala oku ongela aamwoye, nganhyi ohuhwa hayi ongele ouhuhwena wayo momawawa yawo, ndele nye inamu hala. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Tala, otembeli yeni otayi fiwa shinya. Ndele andi mu lombwele, ihamu mono nge ali siyo efimbo ali fiki, nhyi amu ka tya, ‘Na yambekwe ngu te ya mevina lyOmwene.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omunauvu omulumenhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Esiku limwe lyEsabati, Yesus okwa li a ya a ka lya meumbo lyaumwe womaaleli Aafalisai. Aanhu oya li yemu kotokela. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Komeho yaye okwa li ku na omulumenhu a zida omaulu nomaako. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesus okwa pula aalongimhango nAafalisai, “Omhango oya pitika tuu oku eluva mesiku lyEsabati nenge ahawe?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ndele inaa yamukula sha. Yesus okwa kufa omulumenhu ngo, ndee temu yeluva, ndee temulombwele a ye. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Opo nee Yesus okwe ya lombwele ta ti, “Olye womunye ngeno e na omonamati nenge ongobe, ndee ta yi wile momufima, ihe yi hilimo molwanhyi omesiku lyEsabati?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Yesus nhyi a popya nhyi, inaa vula oku mu yamukula.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eihupipiko neyakulo lyaayenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesus okwa vibulula nghee aayenda yamwe yali taye ihoololele oipundi yasimana, onghee okwe ya lombwela eyele ta ti, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nge opu na ngu e ku hiya koshitufi shohango, ino kala omutumba koipundi yasimana, oshonhyi a shi vulika pu na umwe a hiwa, a simana e ku vule. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Omwiifani weni amuhe yaali ote ya, ndee teku lombwele ta ti, ‘Pa mukweni ngu ehala ndyo.’ Oto ka kala wa sa ohoni, molwanhyi ouna okuka kala omutumba kehala lyokonima. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ndee nge owa hiwa, inda, ka kale omutumba kehala lyokonima, opo ngu e ku hiya nge te ya, oteku lombwele ta ti, ‘Kaume kange, ila nghu, kehala ndi oliwa.’ Nhyi ashi ku simanekifa momeho yaayenda ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Oshonhyi kehe omwiinenepeki ota shonopekwa, na kehe omwiishonopeki ota nenepekwa” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Opo nee Yesus okwa lombwela ngu e mu hiya ta ti, “Nge to teleke omuha nenge oulalelo, ino hiya ookaume koye nenge aamwanyoko nenge aakwanezimo lyoye nenge aashinda shoye mba aakengeli, yeke kwiifane wo, nomomukalo mbu otaeku futu munhyi weya ningila. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ndele nge to ningi oitelekela, hiya eehepele, oitinhingili, oilema naaposi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Oto yambekwa, shaanhyi kaye na sha shoku ku pa. Ndele oto ka futwa kuKalunga, efimbo ndi mba ya longa ouwa taa ka umuvwa kousi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyoshitufi oshinene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Wumwe womumba ya li poshililo nhyi e shi uva, okwa ti kuYesus, “Aanelao oyo mba taa ka lya poshililo mOuhamba waKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesus okwa ti ku ye, “Omulumenhu umwe okwa longekiva oshitufi oshinene, ndee ta hii aanhu oyendji. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Efimbo lyoshitufi nyi lya fika, okwa tuma omupiya wae a ka ifane aahiwa ta ti, ‘Ileni, ayihe oya longekivwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ndele ayehe oya anya momukalo umwe. Wotango okwa ti komutumwa, ‘Ame opo nda landa epya, ondi na okuya ko, ndi ke li tale. Vimina nge po.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mukwawo okwa ti komutumwa, ‘Onda landa oumutanda omulongo, ondi na oku ya ko, ndike u veule. Vimina nge po.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Wumwe natango okwa ti, ‘Ame opo nda hombola, ihandi vulu okuuya.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Omumati okwa shuna, ndele ta hokololele mwene wae ashihe. Omulumenhu mwene weumbo okwa handuka, ndele ta ti komupiya wae, ‘Endelela, inda keendjila nokomipandaida vomoshilando, ndee to eta eehepele noingudu, naaposi noilema.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Omupiya okwa ti, ‘Mwene wange, nhyi wa popya ondeshi ninga nale ndele natango omu na ehala.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Mwene weumbo okwa lombwela omupiya, ‘Inda keendjila nokeepate voshilongo, kondjifa aanhu yeuye, eumbo lyange li uve, <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />oshonhyi kape na nande oumwe womaalumenhu yenya ya ifanenwe taa makele oulalelo mbu.’<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okulandula Yesus aku pula shike?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mateusa10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Nhyi eengudu eenene vali avi enda pamwe naYesus. Yesus okwa punguluka, ndele ta ti ku yo, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Kehe ngu te ya kwaame, iha vulu okuninga omulongwa wange nge iha vibwa he nayina, omukiinhu wae noyana, aamwayina aalumenhu naakiinhu, ile omwenyo wae mwene nokuli. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Kehe ngu iha vulu okuhinda po omushiyakano wae, ndee ta landulange, iha vulu okuninga omulongwa wange.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Nge oku na umwe e na evilaavilo lyokutunga ongulu, okuna tango okukala omutumba a yalule kutya otayi pula shi fike peni, ye a tale nge okuna oimaliwa ya wana okwiitunga siyo tayi pu. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Opo shiha ninge, nhyi a mana okutunga ekanghameno, nani ihaka vula ali okumana etungo alihe. Ndee ayehe mba taye shi mono, otaye ke mu yola, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />taa ti, ‘Omulumenhu ngu okwa tameka etungo ndele ina vula ali oku li mana.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Nge ohamba yonhumba ta yii yi ka lwife ohamba onghwawo, oyi na okukala omutumba mhanga, yi vilavile nge otai vulu nghaa okukondjifa ngu te ya nomaovi omilongo mbali omhanga yo yi na ike aakwaita omaovi omulongo. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nge iha vulu, ota tumu ko aatumwa kohamba onghwawo manga e li kokule, a indile ombili. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Sho osho nghaa, kaku na nande oumwe womunye ta vulu okuninga omulongwa wange, nge i na efa po ayihe e yi na.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omongwa kauna oshilonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateusa5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malukusa9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Omongwa omuwa, ndele nge owa hauka otau fingalekwa ali nashi? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ihau opalele ali mevu ile mouhoho, ndee otau ekelwahi ike. Ngu e na omakutsi yokupwaikina, na uve ko!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Eele lyozi ya kana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateusa18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Aafendelifi ayehe naalunde oyali ye ya okupwiikina Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ndee Aafalisai naalongimhango oya ngugutula ya ti, “Omulumenhu ngu okwa tambula aalunde, ndee ta li pamwe nayo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesus okwe ya lombwela eyele ndi, a ti,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Natu tye umwe womunye okuna eezi efele limwe, ndee yimwe yomuvo te yi kanifa. Ota ningi ngeepi mbela? Ota fiye po eezi vi omilongo omungoyi nomungoyi, ndee ta ka konga ndji ya kana siyo te yi mono. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nge e yi mona, ota hafa neenghono, ndee te yi hindi po komapepe yaye, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ndee teyi eta keumbo. Opo nee ota ifana ookaume naashiinda shaye ta ti, “Hafeni pamwe naame, oshonhyi ozi yange ndji ya li ya kana onde yi mona.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Andi mu lombwele, “Osho nghaa nomeulu, amu kala ehafo enene, molwomulunde umwe e itevulula, li vulife ndi lyoku hafela omilongo omungoyi nomungoyi, mba ina ya pumbwa eitevululo.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyoshimaliwa sha kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Natu tye, omukiinhu okuna oimaliwa, oisiliveli omulongo, ndele ta kanifa po shimwe, ota ningi ngeepi? Ota hwameke olamba, ndele ta kombo eumbo noku shi konga noupenda, siyo teshi mono. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ndee nge e shi mono, ota ifana ookaume naashiinda shaye ta ti, ‘Hafeni pamwe naame, oshonhyi oshimaliwa shange nhyi sha li sha kana, onde shi mona!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Andi mu lombwele, momukalo wafaafana, aayengeli yaKalunga otaa hafele omulunde umwe e itevulula.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomumati a kanene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesus okwa twikila natango okupopya ta ti, “Okwa li ku na omusamane e na aamati yaali. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ngu omushona kumukwawo okwa ti kuhe, ‘Tate, pe nge ombiga yomaliko ndji ndi na okupewa.’ He okwa topolela oyana yaali eliko ndyo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Inapu pita omasiku omendji, omona ngu omushona okwa landifa po oinima yaye ayihe, ndee ta zi po peumbo, ta ka kala koshilongo shokokule. Okwa hanaunina ko eliko lyaye alihe mokulumba onghalamwenyo youholume. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ndee nhyi a mana po eliko alihe, oshilongo nhyo osha hangika kondjala onene nokwa kala e li momhumbwe onene. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Okwa ya, ndee ta ka longela omukwashiwana omuyamba womoshilongo mo. Omuyamba okwe mu tumu kepya lyaye a ka tonatele oingulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Okwa li e na etimhaumbwile kutya otaka a lya omakunde nga haa liwa koingulu, ndele ine ya pewa. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Opo nee okwa vilaavila, ndee ta ti, ‘Aapiya yatate ayehe oye na oshindji shokulya noshoku siikilila, ndele aame ngu andi si ondjala. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Andi fikama, ndee andi shuna kutate, ndee andi mulombwele, ‘Tate, onda nyona keulu nokoshipala shoye, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />ndee ame inandi wana ali ndi ifanwe omona woe, tambula nge nganhyi umwe womaapiya yoe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Okwa fikama, ndee ta yi kuhe. Ndele mhanga ali e li kokule, he okwe mu mona, ndee okwa li e mu uvitile onghenda. He okwa tondoka eke mu shakeneka, ndee temu papatela, ndee temu hupita. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ndee omona okwe mu lombwela, ‘Tate, onda nyona keulu nokwooye, onghee ame inandi wana ali okwiifanwa omona woe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ndele he okwa lombwela aapiya yaye, ‘Endeleleni, ka eteni onguwo ndji oiwa lela, mu shi mu zike, nokalinga mu ka zike komunwe wae, neenghaku mu mu zike keemhavi. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ndee indeni mu ka taleko onhana ndji ya ondoka, i tomeni tu lyeni se tu hafeni, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />molwanhyi omumwange okwa li a sa, ndele paife okwa umuka, okwa li a kana, ndele paife okwa monika.’ Opo nee oya hafela pamwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Omumwae ngu omukulunhu okwa hangika mepya. Nhyi e uya, a fika popepi neumbo, okwa uva olwiimbo nouvano. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Okwa ifana omupiya umwe, ndee te mu pula nhyi shi li meumbo. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Omupiya okwa yamukula, ‘Mumwanyoko okwe ya, ho okwe mu tomena onhana yinya ya ondoka, molwanhyi okwe mu mona e na omwenyo.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Omonamati ngu omukulunhu okwa handuka ndee ta kala ina hala okuya mo meumbo. He okwe ya pondje, ndee te mu indile a ye meumbo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ndele omumati okwa ti kuhe, ‘Tala, onda kala pwooye eevula avihe vi andi ku longele ongomupika, inandi nyona nande oshipango shoye shimwe. Ndele ino pange nande okakombwena ndi hafe pamwe nookaume kange. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ndele omona woe ngu a manena po eliko lyoye meembwada nhyi e uya, owe mu tomena onhana ndji ya ondoka.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />He okwe mu lombwela, ‘Mumwange, oye owa kala aluhe pwaame, ndee ayihe yange oyoe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ndee paife otu na okutyapula nokuhafa, molwanhyi mumwanyoko, okwa li a sa, ndele paife okwa ninga ali omunamwenyo, okwa li a kana, ndele paife okwa monika.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Eele lyomutonateli omwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ndee Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye ta ti, okwa li ku na omulumenhu omuyamba, e na omutonateli weumbo lyaye, ngu aku popiwa a li ta hanauna po eliko lyomuhona wae. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Omuyamba okwa ifana omutonateli ndee ti kuye, “Onduuvite oshindji kombiga yoe. Penge eyalulo lyoinima ayihe mbi ya li metonatelo lyoye, molwanhyi ihoka twikila ali nokutonatela omaliko yange.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Omutonateli okwe ipopila ta ti, “Ondi na okuninga ngeepi, nhyi omuhona wange ta kufa nge moilonga? Okulima ihandi ku vulu, oku ehela onda sa ohoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nhyi ndi na okuninga ondi shi shii, opo aanhu ya tambule nge momaumbo yawo ngeege nda tewa mo moilonga. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Okwa ifana kehe ngu a li e na eenguga vomuhona wae, ndee ta ti ku ngu e ya mo tango, ‘Ouna eenguga vomuhona wange vi fike peni?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Okwa yamukula, ‘Omaela yomaavi efele limwe’. Omupiya okwa ti, ‘Kufa omushangwa weenguga voye, kala omutumba, ndee to shanga po omilongo nhano.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Natango okwa pula mukwawo, ‘Oye ouna eenguga va ingapi?’ Okwa yamukula, ‘Eeshako voilya eyovi limwe.’ Omupiya okwa ti, ‘Kufa omushangwa weenguga voye, kala omutumba, ndee to shanga po omafele yahetatu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ndee omuhona womutonateli okwe li pandula, molwanhyi lya longa neenduge. Oshonhyi aakolokohi naanhu mba haa yende pauyuni mbu, oye iwete ye na eenduge ye vule oyana yaKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ndee Yesus okwa ti, “Onghee hano andi mu lombwele, ikongeleni ookaume neliko lyounyuni mbu, opo nge ali hulupo, muka tambulwe meumbo lyaaluhe. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ngu omwiineekelwa moinima mbi oishona, ote ineekelelwa nambi oinene, nangu omunaipupulu moinima oishona, ye omunaipupula nomumbi oinene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nge kamu shi aayineekelwa mokulongifa eliko lyomouyuni mbu, amu vulu ngeepi okwiineekelelwa eliko lyoshili? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Nongeege kamu shi aayineekelwa moinima mbi kaishi yeni, olye te mu pe mbi yeni yene? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Kaku na omupiya ta vulu okulongela aahona yaali; oshonhyi ota tondo umwe, ndee ta kala e hole mukwawo, nenge ta simaneke ngu, ndee ta vini wiinya. Ihamu vulu okulongela Kalunga noimaliwa pefimbo limwe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eehapu vimwe vaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mateusa11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Malukusa10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Nhyi Aafalisai ya uva oinima mbi ya popiwa kuYesus, oya yola, molwanhyi oya li ye hole oimaliwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nye ohamu iyulike aayuki momeho yaanhu, ndele Kalunga okushii omitima veni nyhi vi li. Oshonhyi nhyi aanhu ya tala shina esimano, osho oihuna koshipala shaKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Omhango yaMoses nomanyolo yaahunganeki oya huulila muYohanesa. Okuza mho, Onghundana Oiwa tayi popi Ouhamba waKalunga otawuuvifwa, nakehe umwe ota kondjifa a ye mo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ndele okuhulapo kweulu nevu okuhwepo ku vule okukanapo kwokanghwanu kamwe komomhango. <verse eid="LUK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Kehe omulumenhu ngu ta henge po omukiinhu wae, ndee ta hombola po umwe, ota hondele. Ndee nangu ta hombola omuhengwa ota hondele.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omuyamba naLasalus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Okwa li ku na omulumenhu omuyamba, ha zala oikutu yondilo noha lumbu onghalamwenyo oiwa kehe esiku. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Posheelo sheumbo lyaye opwa li hapu kala ohepele yevina Lasalus, yi na omafina olutu aluhe. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ohepele ndji ohai kala ya hala okulya oundjaumuke mbu tau wu koshitaafula shomuyamba. Olundji eembwa oha vi ya, ndee avi lafa omafina yaye. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Hano ohepele ndji nhyi ya sa, oya papatelwa kaayengeli ndee taye mu fala meulu puAbeleham. Omuyamba naye okwa sa, ndee ta fundikwa, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />nomoshaasi okwa kala moululume. Nhyi a yelufa omeho kokule naye, okwa mona Abeleham ye li naLasalus. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Okwa ingiva a ti, ‘Tate Abeleham! Sila nge onghenda, u tume Lasalus, a ye omunwe wae momeya, ndee ta taalelife kelaka lyange, oshonhyi ondili moululume omundji momundilo!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ndele Abeleham okwa ti kuye, ‘Mumwange, vibuluka kutya mhanga wa li momwenyo, owa pelwe oinima ayihe oiwa, ndele Lasalus okwa pelwe oinima ayihe mbi oiyi. Paife Lasalus okuli mehala oliwa, a mbilipalelwa, mhanga oye to lulumikwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ndele nande ongaanhyo, pokati ketu nooye opuna elambo eleka, opo mba ya hala okutaulukila kunye, nenge mba ya hala okutaulukila kuse inaye shi vula.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Omuyamba okwa ti, ‘Andi ku indile tatekulu, u tume Lasalus keumbo lyatate, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ondina ko aamwameme aalumenhu yatano, opo e ke ya londove, ina ye ya mehala ndi lyoululume’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abeleham okwa ti, ‘Aamwanyoko oye na Moses naahunganeki, naye ya pwiikine.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Omuyamba okwa yamukula, ‘Ahawe tate Abeleham! Ngeno okwa li taku umuka umwe womaasi, ndee ta yi kuyo, ngeno ota ye itevulula.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abeleham okwa ti, ‘Nge inaa pwaikina Moses naahunganeki, natango iha ya itaelifwa nande naku yumuke umwe kaasi.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 17</para>
  <para style="s">Oulunde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mateusa18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:22">21:22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Malukusa9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye, “Oinima mbi ayeeta omunhu a nyone oyi na okuuya, ndele oihuna komunhu ngu te yi eta! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ngu ta hongolola kamwe komoushona mbu, okwa wana a mangelwe emanya eviyu mofingo, ndee ta umbilwa mefuta. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Onghee hano kotokeleni nhyi amu ningi. Mukweni nge a nyona, mu ngada, nonge e itevulula, mu vimina po. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nonge ta nyono kooye luheyali mesiku, ndele ote ya kooye menyono kehe ta ti, ‘Onde itevulula,’ mu viminapo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eitaelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Aayapostoli oya lombwela Omwene ya ti, “Indjipaleka eitaelo lyetu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Omwene okwa yamukula, “Ngeno omwa li mu na eitaelo li fike pomuma ndji oshona lela, ngeno amu vulu okulombwela omuti mbu omunene mbu, ‘Itumba po mha, wu iyumbile mefuta!’ Ndee otau vulika kunye.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshinakuwanifwa shomupiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Natu tye, oku na omunhu mokati keni e na omupiya wae ta longo mepya nenge ta lifa eezi. Nge ta zi mepya, oto mu lombwele to ti, ‘Endelela wuuye u lye’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Hasho ndishi, ndele ote mu lombwele, ‘Tulilange po oulalelo, ndee to izaleke wuuye u yakule nge, mhanga andi li ame andi mu.’ Opo nee to vulu okulya nokunwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Omupiya iha pewa olupandu lweikalekelwa molwanhyi a longa nhyi mwene wae e mu lombwelwa a longe. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Hano osho nanyeenye, nge omwa wanifa ayihe mbi mwa lombwelwa, omuna okutya, ‘Se aapiya kayena oshilonga, nhyi twa longa ike nhyi twa pewa tu longe.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva aalumenhu omulongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Mokuya kuYelusalema, Yesus okwa enda ta kunghula neengaba vopokati kaSamalia naGalilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nhyi e ya momukunda umwe, okwa shakenekwa kaalumenhu omulongo ye na oshilundu. Oyali ya fikama kokule naye, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />noya ingiva ya ti, “Yesus! Omwene! Tusila onghenda!<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesus okwe ya tala ndee ti kuyo, “Indeni muke iyulike komuyambi.” Mhanga ya li mondjila taa yi, oya eluka. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ndele umwe womuyo nhyi a mona kutya okwa yeluka, okwa shuna kuYesus, ndee ta hambelele Kalunga newi li li pombada. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Okwa twa eengolo peemhavi vaYesus ndee temu pandula. Omulumenhu ngu okwa li Omusamaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ti, “Aalumenhu mba ya yeluvwa kaye li omulongo? Omungoyi oye li peni? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Omolwashike omukwailongo oye ike a aluka ahambelele Kalunga.” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesus okwe mu lombwela, “Fikama u ye, eitaelo lyoye olye ku yelula.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Euyo lyOuhamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateusa24:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Esiku limwe Aafalisai yamwe oya pula Yesus kutya Ouhamba waKalunga otawuuya naini. Yesus okwe ya yamukula ta ti, “Ouhamba waKalunga ihawuuya momukalo uwetike. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kaku na ngu ta ti, ‘Tala, owo mbu nenge owo wiinya.’ Molwanhyi Ouhamba waKalunga ouli meni munye.” <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Nena Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye ta ti, “Aku ke ya efimbo, nhyi amu ka hala okumona nande esiku limwe lyOmona wOmunhu, ndele iha mu keli mona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Aku ka kala mba taye mu lombwele taa ti, ‘Tala kwiinya, nenge tala nghu.’ Inamu ya ko, nye inamu ya landula. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Oshonhyi nganhyi naana olwaavi alu avima keulu, okuza kombiga yimwe siyo okonghwao, osho nghaa nOmona wOmunhu taka kala mesiku lyaye. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ndele tango oku na okuhepekwa nomahepeko omendji nokweekelwahi kaanhu yopefimbo ndi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Oshonhyi nganhyi sha li pomafimbo yaNoa, osho tuu ashi ka kala pomasiku yOmona wOmunhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Aanhu oya li taa li nokunwa, okuhombola nokuhombolifa, siyo esiku ndi Noa a ya monguluwato. Eelu olye ya, ndee a li ya hanauna po ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Aku ka kala nganhyi pomafimbo yaLot. Aanhu oya li ye hole okulya nokunwa, okulanda nokulandifa, okukuna nokutunga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Esiku ndi Lot a za mo muSodom, omundilo nomamanya yosulufuli oya wa keulu, noya hanauna po ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Hano osho ashi ka kala nomesiku ndi Omona wOmunhu ta ka holoka.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mesiku ndyo, ngu ta hangika kombada yonduda a fiya oinima yaye meumbo, ina kuluka ko, e ke yi tale; osho tuu ngu ta hangikwa mepya, ina alukila meumbo. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Vibulukeni omukulukavi waLot! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Kehe ngu ta kambavala okuhupifa omwenyo wae, ote wu kanifa, nangu tewu kanifa ote wu hupifa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Andi mu lombwele, ongulohi ndjo, aanhu yaali ya nangala pombete yimwe; umwe ota kufwa po namukwawo ota fiwa po. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Aakiinhu yaali taa tu poshini; umwe ota kufwa po, mukwawo ta fiwa po. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Aalumenhu yaali ye li mepya; umwe ta kufwa po, mukwawo ta fiwa po.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Aalongwa oye mu pula ya ti, “Nhyi ashi ka ningilwa peni Omwene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesus okwa yamukula a ti, “Nghu ku na omuviba, oko haku wile eenhwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 18</para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomuselekavi nomupanguli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesus okwe ya lombwela eele ndi, opo e ya longe nghee ye na okukala taa yalikana aluhe, yo ya kale ye na omukumo, a ti,<verse eid="LUK 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />“Moshilando shimwe omwa li omupanguli iha tila Kalunga, ye ke na ko nasha naanhu ooyakwawo. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Moshilando omo tuu mo, omwa li wo omuselekavi, he ya olundji komupanguli hemwiindile ta ti, ‘Kwafela nge kombinga yeenhamanana pokati ketu nomutamaneki wange.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Omutokoli okwa anya efimbo eleka, ndele konima okwe ipopila a ti: ‘Nande ihandi tila Kalunga, ame hina ko nasha nooyakwetu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />omuselekavi ngu andi mu pangula pauyuuki, opo ina piyaaneka nge ali nokuuya kwaame olundji lundji.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Omwene okwa ti, pwaikineni omupanguli omukeenouyuuki nhyi a ti, <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Kalunga iha pangula pauyuki aahoololwa yaye mba haye mu ifana ousiku nomutenya? Ote ya teelelifa nghaa efimbo eleka ine ya kwafa? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Andi mu lombwele, ote ya ufile pangula pauyuki meendelelo. Nhyi Omona wOmunhu teke ya, ota ka hanga ko tuu eitaelo kombada yevu?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyOmufalisai nomufendelifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesus okwa popya eyele ndi, kumba ya li ye iwete aayuuki, ye ineekela muyo yene, noya li ya vina aanhu yakwawo. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Okwa li ku na aalumenhu yaali ya ka yalikana kotembeli, umwe Omufalisai namukwawo omufendelifi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Omufalisai okwa fikama e ikalela, ndele ta yalikana puye mwene ta ti, ‘Kalunga, andi ku hambelele, molwanhyi ame inandi fa aanhu yamwe; eembuvi, aakolokohi naahondeli, andi ku hambelele natango molwanhyi inandi fa omufendelifi ngu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Oikulya ohandi ivilike luyali kehe moshiike, ohandi ku pe oshitimulongo shomoilikolwa yange ayihe.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Ndele omufendelifi okwa fikama kokule, ye ina vula okutala keulu, oshonhyi okwa sa oluhovi, ndele ta ti, ‘Kalunga sila nge onghenda, oshonhyi ame omulunde!’” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ti, “Andi mu lombwele; omufendelifi okwa shuna keumbo a viminwa po koshipala shaKalunga e vule mukwawo. Molwanhyi ngu te inenepeke ota shonopekwa, nangu te ishonopeke ota nenepekwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yambeke ounona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateusa19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malukusa10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Aanhu yamwe oya eta ouhanona wawo kuYesus opo e wu tenheke omake. Aalongwa nhyi yeshi mona, oya ngada mba ye wu eta. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ndele Yesus okwa ifana ounona auhe, wu uye kuyeeye a ti, “Efeni ounona wu uye kwaame, inamu wu keelela ko, oshonhyi Ouhamba waKalunga owa mba ye wu fa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, kehe ngu iha tambula Ouhamba waKalunga ongokaana, iha yi mo muwo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulumenhu omuyamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateusa19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malukusa10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Wumwe womaaleli Aayuda okwa pula Yesus ta ti, “Mulongi omuwa, nandi longe shi opo ndi mone omwenyo waaluhe?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesus okwe mu pula, “Omolwashike toti nge omuwa? Kaku na nande omunhu omuwa, oKalunga oye auke. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Oipango owu yi shii, ‘Ino hondela, Ino yaka, Ino lundila, Simaneka ho nanyoko.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Omulumenhu okwe mu yamukula a ti, ‘Mbi ayihe onde yi wanifa okuza mounyasha wange.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesus nhyi e shi uva, okwa ti kuye, “Oku na oshiima shimwe natango u na okushi ninga. Landifa po ayihe mbi u na, oimaliwa to yi pe eehepele, oye to kala u na eliko meulu, opo u landulange. <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ndele nhyi a uvu nhyi, okwa uva nayi, oshonhyi okwa li omuyamba. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesus nhyi a vibulula kutya omulumhenhu okwa uva nayi okwa ti kuye:” Oshiviyu ngeepi omuyamba a ye mOuhamba waKalunga! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Okupita kwongamelo meulu lyongwiya okuhwepo ku vule okuya kwomukengeli mOuhamba waKalunga.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Mba ye shi uva oya ti, “Hano mba taa hupifwa aangaleni nani?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Nhyi ashi nyenge aanhu ihashi nyenge Kalunga.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Ndele Peetulusa okwati, “Tala, “Se otwa fiya po omaumbo yetu, ndee atu ku landula.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Oshili, andi mu lombwele, Kehe ngu ta fiye po eumbo lyaye nenge omukiinhu wae, nenge mumwainamati nenge aavali yaye, nenge ounona wae omolwOuhamba waKAlunga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ota ka mona oyindji mouyuni mbu, nomwenyo waaluhe ote ke wu pewa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi kombiga yeso lyaye olutitatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateusa20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malukusa10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesus okwe ikalekela aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali ndele ta ti kuyo: “Taleni, atu yeni kuYelusalema, nghu a ku ka wanifilwa ayihe mbi ya shangwa kaahunganeki tayi popi Omona wOmunhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Otaka yandjwa moikaha yamba ka ye shi Aayuda, mba taye ke mu yola, taye ke mu sheka, ndee taye ke mu siila omate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Otaye ke mu vega, ndele taye mu vipaya, ndele konima yomasiku yatatu otaka umuvwa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ndele aalongwa oya li kaye uviteko nande osha, oshonhyi eehapu ova li ve ya holekwa, inaya uva ko kutya, Yesus okwa hala okutya shike.”<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yeluva omweeheli omuposi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateusa20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malukusa10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesus nhyi e ya popepi naYeliko, opwa li omulumenhu omuposi ta ehela peeha vondjila. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Nhyi a uva ongudu yaanhu tayi ende po, okwa pula a ti, “Oshishi nhyi?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Aanhu oye mu lombwele ya ti, “OYesus ngu a za kuNasaleta ta ende po.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Opo nee okwa ingiva a ti, “Yesus! Omona waDavid! Sila nge onghenda!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Aanhu mba ya li komeho oye mu ngada, a mwene, ndee okwa viinine okwiingiva mopale a ti, “Omona waDavid! Sila nge onghenda!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesus okwa fikama ndee teya lombwele ya ete omuposi kuye. Nhyi e ya lwopopepi, Yesus okwe mu pula, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Owa hala ndi ku ningile shike?” Ye okwa ti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Omwene, onda hala ndi mone ko natango.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Opo nee Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Mona ko! Eitaelo lyoye olye ku yeluva.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Viyaviya okwa mona ko, ndele ta landula Yesus nokupandula Kalunga. Aanhu nhyi ye shi mono, ayehe oya hambelele Kalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 19</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus naSakeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesus nhyi a li ta ende mu Yeliko, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />opwa li puna omulumenhu omukulunhu waafendelifi wevina Sakeus. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Sakeus okwa li ha kala a hala okumona Yesus, ndele molwanhyi kwa li omuhupi nomolwoundji waanhu, kali ta vulu okumu mona. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Okwa matuka, a tetekela ongudu yaanhu komeho, ndele ta londo pombada yomuti opo a vule okumona Yesus, ngu a li ta ende po. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesus nhyi a fika mha Sakeus a londa, okwa tala pombada ndee ta ti ku Sakeus, “Sakeus, endelela londoloka ko ngho, oshonhyi ondi na oku ka kala meumbo lyoye nena.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakeus okwa endelela okulondoloka ndee ta tambula ko Yesus nehafo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Aanhu ayehe mba yeshi mona oya ngugutula ya ti, “Ngu otayi a ka talelepo meumbo lyomulunde.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Sakeus okwa fikama, ndee ta lombwele Omwene ta ti, “Pwiikina! Etata lyeliko lyange andi keli pa eehepele, nonge opuna ngu nda nyeka nenge nda longifa oipupulu, andi ke mu shunifila oinima yaye lune.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Kalunga okwa hupifa eumbo ndi nena, nganhyi Sakeus naye okwa ninga omukwanezimo waAbeleham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Molwanhyi Omona wOmunhu okwe ya okukonga nokuhupifa mba ya kana.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">eele lyoimaliwa oikukutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateusa25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yesus okwa hokololela mba ya li ye mu pwaikina eyele. Efimbo ndi, oyali yeli pokufika mu Yelusalema, naanhu oyali yeshii Ouhamba waKalunga owuli pokuholoka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Onghee okwa ti, “Okwa li ku na omulumenhu a valeka, ngu ali ta yi koshilongo shokokule a ka nangekelwe ouhamba ye a yaluke ko. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Mhanga inaya, okwa ifana aapiya yaye omulongo ndee teyape kehe umwe oshimaliwa shimwe oshikukutu, ndee ta ti kuyo, ‘Indeni, mukeyi likolife ikwawo mhanga andi yaluka.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ndele aanhu yomoshilongo shaye oyali yemu tonde ndee tayemu tumine aatumwa yemu lombwele kutya, ‘Inatu hala omulumenhu ngu a ninge ohamba yetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Omulumenhu okwa pewa ouhamba, ndele taaluka. Okwa ifana aapiya yaye ye uye kuyeeye, opo a shiwe kutya oya likola shi fike peni. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wotango okwe ya ndee ti, ‘Muhona, oshimaliwa shoye shimwe onde shi likolifa ikwawo omulongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Ye okwa ti, ‘Iyaloo, omupiya omuwa! Molwanhyi owumwiineekelwa moinima oishona, andi kupe epangelo lyoilando omulongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Omutiyali okwe ya ndee ti, ‘Muhona, oshimaliwa shoye shimwe oshikukutu ondeshi likolifa ikwawo itano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Ngu okwe mu lombwele a ti, ‘Oye oto ka pangela oilando itano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mukwawo okwe ya, ndee ta ti, ‘Muhona, oshimaliwa shoye osho nhyi, onda kala ndeshi tula moshikaiwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ondali ndeku tila, oshonhyi oye omulumenhu omuviyu. Oho kufa nanhyi kaishi shoye, noho teya nhyi ino kuna.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Omuhona wae okwa ti kuye, ‘Oye omupiya omwii! Andi ku pangula omolweehapu voye. Wu shii nge ndimuviyu, handi kufa nhyi kashi shi shange nohai teya mha inandi kuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Omolwashi ino tula oimaliwa yange mombaaga? Opo ngeno nhyi andi aluka, ngeno onda alulilwa nhyi shange kwa wevelwa noihohela.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Ohamba oya lombwela mba yali ya fikama mho ya ti, ‘Mu kufeni oshimaliwa nhyo, nye mu shi pe ngu a likolifa oimaliwa omulongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Aanhu oya ti kuye, ‘Muhona, ngo oku na nale oimaliwa ya wana.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Okwe yamukula, ‘Andi mu lombwele; Kehe ngu e na sha, otaa ka pewa oshindji, ndee mba ka ye na sha, noshishona nhyi yena ota ye ke shi kufwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Paife aatondi yange mba yali inaahala ndi ninge ohamba, ya eteni mha mu ya vipaele komeho yange!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yi muYelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateusa21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malukusa11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohanesa12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Konima nhyi Yesus a popya nhyi, okwe ya tetekela kuYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nhyi a fika popepi naBetfage naBetania pondudu yeeholivi, okwa tuma aalongwa yaye yaali komeho <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />nelombwelo ndi, “Indeni komukunda u li komeho yeni. Nge mwa fika ko, amu ka mona ko ondoogi ya mangwa, inayi kailwa nande onale. Yi mangululeni ndee amu yi eta nghu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ngeege opuna umwe temu pula kutya amu yi mangululile mo shi? Mu lombweleni kutya, Omwene okwe yi pumbwa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Mba ya tumwa oya ya, noya hanga ayihe yi li nganhyi Yesus eyi ya lombwela. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Mhanga ya li ta ya mangululamo ondoogi, mwene wayo okwe ya pula a ti, “Omolwashi amu yi mangulula mo?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Oya yamukula ya ti “Mwene okwe yi pumbwa.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Oya eta ondoogi kuYesus ndee taa yala oikutu yawo pombuda yako, ndee taa kwafele Yesus a kaile. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Mhanga a kaila, aanhu oya yala oikutu yawo mondjila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Nhyi a fika popepi naYelusalema, pehala mha ondjila ta yi kuluka ta yi zi kondudu yeeholivi, ongudu onene yaalongwa yaye oya tameke okupandula nokuhambelela Kalunga mopale, omoilonganghono ayihe mbi ya mona <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />ya ti, “Omuyambekwa ohamba ndji tayi ya mevina lyOmwene! Ombili meulu neyavimo pombadambada. <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Yamwe yomAafalisai ya li mongudu yaanhu oya ti kuYesus “Mulongi ngada aalongwa yoe ya mwene.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Andi mu lombwele; ngeege oya mwena, omamanya otaa tameke okukuwilila.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lili molwa Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesus nhyi a fika popepi noshilando Yelusalema, okwe shi tala, ndele teshi lili <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />a ti, “Owa li wa pumbwa okushiwa nhyi ashi ku kwafele molwombili yoe, ndele paife ihamu vulu okushuuvako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Omasiku otaye ke ya, mha aatondi yoe taye ke ku kondeka, ndele taye ku vigilile keembiga avihe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Otaye ke ku hanauna po filufilu naanhu ayehe ye li mo, ihaa ka fiya nande emanya lya londa kekwawo inaye li kumuna po, molwanhyi ino vibulula efimbo ndi Kalunga e ya e ku hupife.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yi kOtembeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateusa21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malukusa11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohanesa2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesus okwa ya molwuumbo lwotembeli, mu a hanga mo aanhu taa landifilemo oinima yawo, ndee ta tameke oku ya tamo. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Okwa ti kuyo, “Okwa shangwa, ‘Otembeli yange oyina okukala Eumbo lyomayalikano,’ ndele nye omwe li ninga ehala lyaanyeki.” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Esiku kehe Yesus okwa kala ta longo motembeli. Aawilikiyambi naalongimhango naakulunhu yoshiwana oya li ya hala ye mu vipae, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ndele oya nyengwa oku shi ninga, molwanhyi aanhu ayehe oya li ye na ehalo okupwiikina Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 20</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta pulwa kombiga yepangelonghono lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateusa21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malukusa11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Esiku limwe, mhanga Yesus a li ta longo aanhu ye te ya uvifile Onghundana Oiwa molwuumbo lwotembeli, aawiliki yaayambi naalongimhango naakulunhu yoshiwana oye ya <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ndee taa ti kuye, “Tulombwela, okepangelonghono lyalye ho longo ngaanhyi? Olye e ku pa epangelo lyokuninga oinima yi li nhyi? <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Naame andi mu pula epulo limwe. Lombweleinge, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />eshasho lya Yohanesa olya za meulu nenge omaanhu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Oya kundafana ya ti, “Ngeege otwa ti; ‘Olya za meulu,’ otaka pula kutya, Omolwashi inamu itaela Yohanesa?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nonge otwa ti; ‘Omaanhu,’ aanhu ayehe mba otae ke tu vipaa nomamanya, shaanhyi oya itaela kutya Yohanesa omuhunganeki.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Oya yamukula ya ti, “Katu shii mha lya za.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Hano naame ihandi mu lombwele kutya okeenghono valye andi longo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">eele lyaahiili yepya lyomiviinyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateusa21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malukusa12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Opo nee Yesus okwa lombwela aanhu eyele ndi, “Omulumenhu umwe okwa twika omiti vomiviinyu mepya lyaye. Okwa kongela mo aalongi yepya lyomiviinyu, ndele ta yi koshilongo shimwe, nghu a ka kala ko efimbo eleka. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Efimbo lyokukola omaviinyu nhyi lya fika, okwa tuma omupiya wae kaahiili yepya lyomiviinyu, opo ye mu pe oiyimati mbi ena okukala a pewa. Ndele aahiili oya vega omupiya, ndee taye mu shunifa eenyala vashinya. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Okwa tumako ali omupiya umwe. Nangu oyemu vega, ndee taye mu shunifa eenyala vashinya. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Natango okwa tumako omupiya omutitatu. Naye aahiili oye mu vega, ndee taye mu temo mepya. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Opo nee mwene wepya lyomiviinyu okwa ti, ‘Andi tumu ko omumwange omuholike pamwe ngu otaye mu simaneke!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ndele aalongi yepya nhyi yemu mona, oye ipopila ya ti, ‘Ngu omona wamwene wepya. Natu mu vipayeni opo eliko li ninge lyetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Oye mu tamo mepya, ndee ta ye mu vipaa.’ Yesus okwa pula, “Mbela mwene wepya lyomiviinyu nhyi teya, aahiili yepya oteya ningi ngeepi?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Oteya vipaa, ndee epya lyomiviinyu teli yandja po kuyamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Aanhu nhyi yeshi uva, oya ti, “Ihashi vulika!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesus okweya tala, ndee teya pula ta ti, “Enyolo ndi ali ti ngeepi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Emanya ndi aatungi ya ekelahi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">olyo lya ninga emanya lya simana li vule ayehe.” <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />“Kehe ngu ta pundukile kemanya ndyo, ota teka; nangu ta wilwa kemanya ndyo ota nyanyaulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epulo kombiga yokufuta oifendela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateusa22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malukusa12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Aalongimhango naawiliki yaayambi aakulunhu oya kambavala okukwata Yesus pefimbo mho, molwanhyi oya vibulula kutya, oyo taa popiwa meyele ndi, ndee oya tila aanhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Oya kala taa kongo omhito natango. Oya futa meholamo aalumenhu yamwe, ye ininge yafa aayuuki. Aanaineya oya tumwa ya ye kuYesus opo yemu kwate meehapu, opo ye mu yandje kepangelo nomeufo lyomuleli woshilongo. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aalumenhu aanaineya oya ti kuYesus, “Mulongi, otu shi shii kutya oho popi noho longo aanhu nhyi shi li mondjila. Iho tala kondodo yomunhu, nondjila yaKalunga oto yi longo paushili. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tu lombwela, osha pitikwa tu yandje oifendela komupangeli waLooma nenge inashi pitikwa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesus okwa vibulula ekoto lyao, ndee ta ti kuyo, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ulukileninge oshimaliwa shaLooma. Oshipala nevina ndi li li ko olyalye?” Oya yamukula, “Olyomupangeli waLooma.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Opo nee Yesus okwe ya lombwela ta ti, “Nhyi shOmuroma shi peni Omuroma nanhyi shaKalunga shi peni Kalunga.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Yo inaa vula okukwata Yesus nande omoshiima shimwe monhaneho yaanhu, onghee oya mwena, ya kuminwa eehapu vaye.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epulo kombiga yeumuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateusa22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malukusa12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Aasadukai yamwe mba haa ti kaku na eumuko oye ya kuYesus noye mu pula ya ti, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mulongi, Moses okwe tu shangela nhyi, ‘Ngeege okuna omulumenhu a sa kena ounona, omukiinhu wae na hombolwe po kumumwaina, opo a monenwe oluvalo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Okwa li aalumenhu ya heyali aamwayina. Wotango okwa hombola, ndee ta si ke na ounona. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Osho nghaa nomutiyali okwa hombola po omuselekavi ngo, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />osho nghaa nomutitatu. Nhyi osha ningilwa aayehe yaheyali, ayehe oya sa kaye na ounona. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Hwiinina, omukiinhu naye okwa ka sa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Esiku ndi aasi taa ka umuvwa, omukiinhu ota ka ninga walye, oshonhyi ayehe yaheyali oya li yemu hombola?” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Aanhu yomouyuni mbu ohaa hombola yo taa hombolwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ndele mba ya talwa ya wana okuumuvwa kousi noya opalela okuya mouyuni winya tawu ke ya, ihaa hombola yo ihaa hombolwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Oya fa aayengeli yaKalunga, ihaa si. Yo oyana yaKalunga, oshonhyi oya umuvwa kousi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />NaMoses okwe shi holola sha yela kutya, aasi otaa ka umuvwa. Mehokololo ndi ali popi oshihwa sha hwama a li ti, Omwene oye Kalunga kaAblaham, Kalunga kaIsaka naKalunga kaYakopo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Kalunga keshi Kalunga kaasi, ndele oKalunga kaanamwenyo, oshonhyi kuyeeye ayehe otaa kala ye na omwenyo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Yamwe yomaalongimhango oya popya taa ti, “Mulongi! Owa yamukula nawa.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Okuza mho, inaa yelekela ali okupula Yesus sha.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epulo kombiga yaKilistus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateusa22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malukusa12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Aanhu otaa vulu ngeepi okutya Kilistus omona waDavid? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Oshonhyi David ye mwene membo lyomapisalomi ota ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Omwene okwa lombwela Omwene wange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Kala omutumba kolulyo lwange,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />siyo andi tula aatondi yoe kohi yeemhavi voye.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />David nge otemu ifana Mwene, hano Kilistus omona pamukalo upi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elondovo kombiga yaalongimhango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateusa23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malukusa12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Aanhu ayehe mhanga ya li taa pwaikine, Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Kotokeleni aalongimhango, mba ye hole okweende ya zala eenguwo eendeka nokukundwa nesimaneko pomalandifilo. Oye hole koipundi yokomeho mOinangoga nopomahala ya simana moitufi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Oha ya kufa oinima nomaumbo yaaselekavi keenghono, nohaa yalikana omayalikano omaleeleka yokwiimonikifako. Otaa ka mona epangulo eviyu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ongalo yomuselekavi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Malukusa12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesus okwa talaatala nokwa mono nghee aakengeli taa umbu ongalo moshikefa shoimaliwa shotembeli. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Okwa mona wo omuselekavi umwe ohepele, a tula mo oupeni uyali. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesus okwa ti, “Oshili andi mu lombwele kutya, kape na omalimbililo, omuselekavi ngu ohepele okwa tula mo oshindji e vule ayehe yamwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Molwanhyi ayehe oya umba ongalo yoimaliwa yomomaliko yawo, ndele omuselekavi moluhepo lwae okwa tula mo ashihe nhyi a li e na okwiipalufa yaye ayihe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi ehanauno lyOtembeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateusa24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malukusa13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Yamwe yomaalongwa oya popya kombiga yOtembeli, nghee ya tungwa nomamanya ya opala, nomaano nga haa pewa Kalunga, ndee Yesus okwa ti, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Ayihe mbi mu wete mbi; efimbo a li keya, ihapu ka fiwa emanya lya londa kekwawo inali kumunwa po.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omauviyu nomahepeko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateusa24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malukusa13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Opo nee aalongwa oyemu pula ya ti, “Mulongi, nhyi ashika ningwa naini? Neviviliko ndi ali ka holola kutya efimbo olya fika mbi yi ningwe lipi?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesus okwa ti, “Kotokeni muha pukifwe. Molwanhyi aku ka holoka aanhu oyendji mevina lyange, taa ti oyo Kilistus, yo taa ti efimbo olya fika. Ndele ina mu ya landula. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Inamu tilifwa nge amu uvu eenghundana voita nomapiyaano. Mbi oyi na okuningwa, ndele ehulilo ina li fika natango.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Natango okwe ya lombwela ta ti, “Oilongo ota yi ka kondjifafana, nomauhamba otaye keilwifa. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Aku keya omakakamo yevu omanene, ondjala, omikifi omiviyu keembiga neembiga. Keulu aku ka holoka omaviviliko omanene nomatilifi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Mhanga ayihe mbi ina yi ningwa, otamu ka kwatwa nokumonifwa oihuna. Otamu ka falwa keemhangu mOinangoga, ndele tamu ka evililwa meevologo. Amu ka falwa koipala yeehamba nomalenga omolwevina lyange.” <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ashika kala omhito yeni, muya lombwele Onghundana Oiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Inamu kala muna, mu na oshimhiyu kutya, amu ke ipopila ngeepi. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Molwanhyi andi ke mu pa oitya neenduge tavi nyenge aatondi yeni ayehe oku mu kondjifa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Amu ka yandjwa moikaha yaataatayi yeni kaakulunhu yeni, kaamwanyoko aalumenhu, kaakwanezimo nokookaume keni, nayamwe yomunye otaa ka vipawa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Amu ka tondwa kwaayehe mevina lyange. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ndele amu ka kala mwa yamenwa, nohuki yimwe yokomitwe veni iha yi ka kana. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kaleni mwa pama momahepeko, opo mu hupife eemwenyo veni.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi ehanauno lyaYelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateusa24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Malukusa13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Nge amu mono Yelusalema sha kondekwa komatanga yaakwaita, shiweni kutya, oshili popepi nokuhanaunwa po. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ayehe mba ye li muYudea naatondokelele keendudu, namba ye li moshilando shoshene naamatuke po; namba taa ka hangika ye li pondje yasho, inaa yalukilamo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Oshonhyi nga oyo omasiku yehandukilo, ewanifo lyaayihe mbi ya shangwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Woo! Oihuna, kaasimba naamwali yopefimbo ndyo! Ouviyu awu ka hanga evu ndi, nehandukilo lyaKalunga otali ke ya kombada yaanhu mba. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Yamwe otaa ka vipawa nemaongamwele, yo yamwe otaa ka tulwa meevologo moilongo ayihe. Aakwailongo otaa ka lela Yelusalema, siyo efimbo lyao a li puko.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Euyo lyOmona wOmunhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Aku ka holoka omaviviliko omatilifi ketango, komwevi nokeenyofi. Aanhu ayehe yokombada yevu otaa ka tila, notaa ka tilifwa kepopomo lyefuta nokomakufikufi yalyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Aanhu otaa ka tila notaa ka ngabuka molwoumbada woinima mbi tayi ka hanga ouyuni auhe, oshonhyi eenghono vomewangandjo avi ka kakamifwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Ndee otaa ka mona Omona wOmunhu te ya, ta endele moshikoo, e na eenghono ovidji neyavimo. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Hano nge ayihe mbi ta yi tameke okuningwa, fikameni, yeluleni omitwe veni, oshonhyi ehupifo lyeni olili popepi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">oshilongwa kuza komukwiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateusa24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malukusa13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ndee okwe ya lombwela eyele ta ti, “Vilaavileni omukwiyu nomiti omikwawo vimwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Omafo yawo nge ta ye ya ko, omushi shii kutya ofinge oyi li popepi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Hano osho nghaa nge a mu mono ayihe mbi ta yi ngwa, kaleni mushi shii kutya, Ouhamba waKalunga ouli popepi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, epipi ihali hulupo, mhanga ayihe mbi inayi ningwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Eulu nevu ali hulu po, ndele eehapu vage ihavi hulu po.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tonateni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Kotokeleni omitima veni nye yene, opo inamu faalelwa koitufi nokoukolwe, noiho yonghalamwenyo ndji, opo esiku ndyo kali mu hange ombaavilila. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Oshonhyi a li ya lya fa omwiyo, a li yakele aanhu ayehe kombada yevu alihe. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Tonateni nye mu yalikane efimbo alihe opo mu mone eenghono vokumu pitifa mwaayihe mbi ta yi ka ningwa, nokufikama koshipala shOmona wOmunhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesus okwa kala ta longo aanhu motembeli kehe esiku, ndee shaa kwa toka, oha yi a ka tokelwe kondudu yeeholivi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Aanhu ayehe oha ya yi kOtembeli ongula kehe, ye kemu pwiikine.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Omhangela yokuvipaa Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateusa26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malukusa14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohanesa11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Efimbo lyOshitufi shEemboloto inavi Fulikwa, hashi ifanwa Opaasa, olyali popepi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Aawiliki yaayambi naalongimhango oya li taa kongo omhito, opo ya vipae Yesus meholeko, shaanhyi oya li ya tila aanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudas a itaela okukengelela Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Satana okwa ya muYudas Iskalioto, ngu a li umwe womaalongwa omulongo nayaali. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Opo nee Yudas okwa ya, ndee ta kundafana naawiliki yaayambi naakulunhu yaanangeli yotembeli nghee e na okuyandja Yesus momake yawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Oyali ya hafa, noya li ya uvaneka yemu pe oimaliwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudas okwe shi itaele nokwa kala ta kongo efimbo oliwa okuyandja Yesus kuyo, mhanga aanhu inaye shi shiwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus te ilongekivile okulya oulalelo wOpaasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateusa26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Malukusa14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohanesa13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Esiku lyOshitufi shEemboloto inavi Fulikwa olya fika, mu ozona yOpaasa yi na okuvipawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesus okwa tuma Peetulusa naYohanesa, nokwe ya lombwela a ti: “Indeni muke tu longekivile oulalelo wOpaasa tu lye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Oye mu pula ya ti, “Owahala tu ke wu longekivile peni?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesus okwa yamukula, “Shaa nhyi mwa yi moshilando, amu ka shakena nomulumenhu a hinda oshishuma shomeya. Mu landuleni siyo omeumbo mu a uka, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ndee amu lombwele mwene weumbo amu ti, Mulongi oteku pula ta ti, ‘Openi puna oshinyanga shaayenda, ndi lile mo pamwe naalongwa yange oulalelo wOpaasa?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ote kemu ulikila onduda onene yopombada ya opalekwa. Longekiveni ayihe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Oya ya, ndele oya hanga ayihe yi li nganhyi Yesus e ya lombwela, ndee taa longekiva oulalelo wOpaasa.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oulalelo wOmwene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Efimbo nhyi lya fika, Yesus okwa kala omutumba poshililo pamwe naatumwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Onda kala nda yeulukwa okulya Opaasa ndji pamwe nanye, mhanga inandi hepekwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Oshonhyi andi mu lombwele, ihandi ka lya ali Opaasa siyo nhyi tayi ka wanifwa mOuhamba waKalunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Yesus okwa kufa eholo ndee ta pandula Kalunga, ndee ta ti, “Tambuleni, mweni mo amuhe. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Andi mulombwele, okuza mha ihandi mu ali omaviinyu, siyo Ouhamba waKalunga tawuuya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Okwa kufa omboloto, ndee ta pandula Kalunga, ndee teyi pambula ndee teya pe ta ti, “Ndu olwo olutu lwange ndu alu mu yandjelwa. Shi ningeni nokuvibuluka nge.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Nhyi ya mana okulya okwe ya pa eholo, ndee ta ti, “Eholo ndi olyo ehangano epe lyohonde yange, ndji tayi tilwahi molweni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ndele tala! Ngu ta kengelele nge opo e li poshililo mha pamwe naame! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Omona wOmunhu oku na okusa, nganhyi Kalunga e shi tokola nale, ndele oihuna oifike peni komunhu ngu te mu kengelele!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Opo nee aalongwa oya tameka okupulafana taa ti, olye ngu womokati kawo te shi ningi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eenhamanana kutya olye omunene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Mokati kawo omwa tukuluka eenhamanana kutya, olye e na okutalwa omukulunhu e vule yakwawo ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Eehamba vomouyuni ohavi pangele aanhu yavo keenghono, naapangeli yavo oya hala ya ifanwe ookaume kaanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ndele nye inamu kala mweya fa. Ngu a simana mokati keni, na kale a fa ina simana, ye omuwiliki na kale onga omuyakuli. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Lombweleni nge, olye a simana pokati kaanhu mba? Oye ngu e li omutumba a teelela okulya nenge oye ngu ta yakula? Ndishi oye ngu e li omutumba. Ndele ame ondili mokati keni ndafa omuyakuli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Omwa kala pamwe naame momauviyu yange ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Nganhyi Tate a pange epitikilo lyokupangela, osho nghaa naame andi mu pe ouhamba mu vule okupangela. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Amu ka lya ndele, amu ka mwa poshililo shange mOuhamba wange, ndele amu ka kala omutumba koipangelapundi, mu pangule omazimo omulongo nayaali yaIsrael.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi eivibiko lyaPeetulusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni! Pwaikina! Satana okwa pewa epitikilo e mu makele amuhe, okutopola oiwa mumbi oiyi, onganhyi omunepya ta topola olungu noilya poshipale. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ndee onde ku yalikanena, opo eitaelo lyoye liha kane. Nonge wa yalukile kwaame, twa yakweni omukumo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Peetulusa okwa ti kuye, “Omwene, onde ilongekiva okuya movologo pamwe nooye nokusa pamwe nooye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Peetulusa, andi ku lombwele, ousiku wonena, mhanga ekondobolo inali lila, otoke ivibika nge lutatu, to ti ku shii nge.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omasiku ya nyika oshiponga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nhyi nde mu tumine, inamu hinda okamhunda koimaliwa, nenge omhunda yokweenda nayo nenge eenghaku, omwa li mwa pumbwa sha?” Yo oya ti, “Aaye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo: “Ndele paife ngu e na okamhunda koimaliwa nenge omhunda yokweenda nayo neyi kufe. Ngu ke na eyongamwele na landife po ombaikifa yaye e li ilandele. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Oshonhyi andi mu lombwele, “Omishangwa vi avi ti, ‘Ye okwa li a talikako ongomukolokohi,’ ovi na okuwanifwa. Oshonhyi ashihe nhyi sha shangwa ashi popi nge, oshi na okuninga shoshili.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Aalongwa oya ti kuye, “Omwene, tala, otu na po omaonga yaali.” Ye okwa ti kuyo, “Osha wana!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yalikana kondudu yeeholivi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateusa26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Malukusa14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesus okwa zamo moshilando ndee ta yi kondudu yeeholivi nganhyi naana a ikilila. Aalongwa yaye oye mu landula. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Nhyi a fika kehala ndyo, okwa ti kuyo, “Yalikaneni opo muha wile momamakelo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Okwe ya fiyapo okanano okashona ndee ta tu eengolo ndee ta yalikana ta ti, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tate, nge oto shi pitike, ekopi ndi lyomahepeko nali pitilile nge po. Ndele hamolwehalo lyange, ndele omolwehalo lyoye li wanifwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Omuyengeli womeulu okwa mu holokela ndee temu nghonopaleke. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Okwa hangika koulululume omundji ndee ta yalikana a mana mo noupyu mbu wa li tawu zi muye owa li omata yohonde taa ndodele pevu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omishangwa vimwe kavina ovelise omilongo ne nanhatu nomilongo ne nane. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Konima yokuyalikana, Yesus okwa shuna kaalongwa yaye, mba a hanga ya kofa molwanhyi oya li ya sa oluhovi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Omolwashi amu kofa? Pendukeni mu yalikane, muha wile memakelo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta mangwa po</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Mhanga a li ta popi, ongudu yaanhu oye ya po, yakwatelwa komeho kuYudas, umwe womaalongwa omulongo nayaali. Yudas okwa heena puYesus, ndee te mu hupita. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Yudas, Omona wOmunhu oto mu kengelele noku mu hupita?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Aalongwa mba ya li pamwe naYesus nhyi ya mona nhyi ashi ningwa, oya ti, “Omwene, natu kondje nomaongamwele yetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Wumwe womaalongwa okwa nghapa umwe womaapiya yomuyambi omukulunhu nokwe mu tete ekutwi lyokolulyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ndele Yesus okwa yamukula a ti, “Opuwo, inamu shi ninga ali!” Yesus okwa kuma okutwi kwomumati, ndee te mu yeluva.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesus okwa lombwela aayambi aakulunhu, aakulunhu yaanangeli yotembeli naakulunhu yoshiwana mba ye ya oku mu kwata a ti, “Omwe ya okukwata nge ongomukulokohi mu na omaongamwele neendibo? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Esiku kehe onda kala nanye motembeli, ndee inamu kwata nge. Ndele ndi olyo efimbo lyeni nolyeenghono vomilaulu vi pangele.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peetulusa te ivibike Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateusa26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Malukusa14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohanesa18:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Oya kwata po Yesus, ndee ta ye mu fala meumbo lyomuyambi omukulunhu. Peetulusa okwa landula mo, e li konima kokule. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Moluumbo lwomeni omwa li mu na yamwe ye li omutumba taa huhulukwa pomundilo. NaPeetulusa okwe ya, ndele ta kala omutumba mongudu yawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Nhyi umwe womaayakuli aakiinhu a mona Peetulusa ta huhulukwa, okwe mu tongolola, ndee ta ti, “Omulumenhu ngu naye okwa li pamwe naYesus.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ndele Peetulusa okwe ivibike a ti, “Mukiinhu, kandi mu shii nande.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Konima yokafimbo natango omulumenhu umwe okwe mu vibulula, ndee ta ti, “Nooye oumwe womuyo.” Peetulusa okwa yamukula a ti, “Menhu ooye, haame.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Nhyi pwa pita owili yimwe, omulumenhu umwe natango okwa koleka a ti, “Oshili, kape na omalimbililo, omulumenhu ngu okwa li pamwe naye, molwanhyi naye Omugalilea.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Peetulusa okwa yamukula a ti “Menhu oye, kandi uvite kutya oto popi kombiga yashi.” Mhanga Peetulusa ali ta popi, ekondobolo olya lila. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Opo nee Omwene okwa punguluka, ndee ta tongolola Peetulusa. Peetulusa okwa vibulula eehapu vOmwene nhyi a tile, “Nena tuu ndji, otoke ivibike nge lutatu mhanga ekondobolo ina li lila. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Peetulusa okwa ya pondje, ndele ta lili nokulililila.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta shekwa ndee ta vegwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateusa26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Malukusa14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Aalumenhu mba ya li ya keelela Yesus oye mu sheka, ndele ta ye mu vege. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Oye mu manga komesho ndee taye mu pula ya ti, “Tengeneka kutya olye e ku vega?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Oye mu sheka nomasheko makwawo omendji omayi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus koshipala shaaleli yoshiwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateusa26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malukusa14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohanesa18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nhyi kwa sha, aakulunhu yoshiwana, aawiliki yaayambi naalongimhango oya ongala, ndee taa eta Yesus moshoongi shawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Mba yali moshoongi oye mu pula ya ti, “Tu lombwela; ooye Kilistus?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesus okwe ya yamukula, “Nande ndi mu lombwele ihamu itaele nge. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Nande ndimu pule epulo limwe, iha mu li yamukula. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ndele okuza mha, a mu ka mona Omona wOmunhu a kala omutumba kolulyo lwaKalunga omunanghono avihe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ayehe oye mu pula ya ti, “Ooye nee Omona waKalunga?” Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nye omwa ti aame.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Yo oya ti, “Se inatu pumbwa nande ombagi yimwe, yi tu hokololele shaanhyi otwe iyuvilako nale se yene keehapu avihe vi a popya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="cl">Lukasa 23</para>
  <para style="s">Yesus koshipala shaPilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mateusa27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Malukusa15:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohanesa18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ongudu ayihe oya fikama noya fala Yesus kuPilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Oya tameke oku mu lundila taa ti: “Otwa kwata omulumenhu ngu, molwanhyi ota pukifa aanhu ye ota keelele aanhu ya yandje oifendela komupangeli Omuroma, ye ote iti oye Kilistus, ohamba.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatus okwe mu pula a ti, “Ooye ohamba yaYuda?” Yesus okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Nganhyi to ti.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatus okwa lombwela aawiliki yaayambi nongudu ayihe yaanhu a ti, “Kandi wete etomhelo lyokutamaneka omulumenhu ngu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ndele aatamaneki oya popya nouviinini ya ti, “Ota piyaaneke aanhu nelongo lyaye muYudea ashihe. A tameka muGalilea, ndee paife oyengu mha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus a tuminwa kuHelod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilatus nhyi e shi uvu okwa pula, “Hano omulumenhu ngu Omugalilea?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nhyi a uva kutya Yesus okwa za koshitopolwa nhyi shili mepangelo lyaHelodesa, okwe mu tumu kuHelodesa, molwanhyi Helodesa okwa li muYelusalema efimbo ndyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helodesa nhyi a mona Yesus, okwa li a hafa neenghono, oshonhyi okwa li ike e mu uva, nokwa kala efimbo eleka a hala oku mu mona, na unene okwa kala a hala a mone Yesus ta longo oshikumwifalonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helodesa okwa pula Yesus omapulo omendji, ndele Yesus ina yamukula. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Aawiliki yaayambi naalongimhango oye ya, ndee taa lundile Yesus neenghono. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Opo nee Helodesa naakwaita yaye oye mu vini, ndee taye mu sheke. Oye mu zaleke onguwo ongohamba, ndee taye mu shunifa kuPilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Oku za kesiku ndyo, Helodesa naPilatus oya panga oukaume, oshonhyi nale oya li ye tondafane.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta pangulilwa eso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateusa27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malukusa15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohanesa18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilatus okwa ifana aawiliki yaayambi, naawiliki naakwashiwana <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ndee te ya lombwele ta ti, “Omwa eta omunhu ngu kwaame amu ti ota pukifa aanhu. Onde mu pula moipafi yeni, ndele inandi mona mo nande ondjo ya sha muye yoku mu pangulifa. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Na Helodesa ine mu mona ondjo yasha, sho osho e mu shunifila kuse, onghee hano taleni, ina ninga sha shoku mu pefa ondjo yoku mu vipaifa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Onda hala ike a vegwe opo nee andi mu efa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omishangwa vimwe kavina ovelise omulongo naheyali.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Opo nee ongudu ayihe oya ingiva ya ti, “Na vipawe! Mangulula Barabbas. <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabbas li a tulwa movologo molwepiyaaneko moshilongo nomolwevipao.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ndele molwa nhyi Pilatus okwa li a hala okumangulula Yesus, okwe ya lombwela natango, <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />ndele oya twikila taa ingiva, “Mu yalela komushiyakano, mu yalela komushiyakano!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilatus okwa ti kuyo olutitatu, “Omolwashi hano? Ouyi wa shi a longa? Ame inandi mu mona ondjo yoku sa. Andi mu vegifa ike ndee andi mu efa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ndele oya twikila nokwiingiva mopale Yesus a yalelwe komushiyakano. Nokonima eindilo lyao olya itaelwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Opo nee Pilatus okwa tokola ehalo lyao liwanifwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Okwa mangulula mo omulumenhu ngu a li a ivililwa movologo, molwolwoovi nendipao, ndee Yesus okwe mu yandja momake yawo yemu ningile nhyi ya hala.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta yaalelwa komushiyakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32">Mateusa27:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malukusa15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohanesa19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Mokweenda kwawo, oya shakena nomulumenhu wevina Simoni, Omukireni, a hangika ta zi kepya lyaye a uka koshilando, ndee taye mu twike omushiyakano.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ongudu onene yaanhu oyali ya landula Yesus, mwakwatelwa nakiinhu mba ya li taa lili yo taa hekumuna omolwae. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesus okwa punguluka, ndee ta tala kuyo ta ti, “Yakiinhu nye Aayelusalem, inamu lila nge, ndele i lileni nye yene noyana yeni. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Oshonhyi omasiku otaye ke ya, mha aanhu taya ka tya, ‘Aanelao aakiinhu mba ihaa mono ounona, ihaa vala yo inaa nyamifa.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Pefimbo ndyo aanhu otaa ka tya, ‘Eendudu, tu yileni! Oikulundudu, tu siikileni!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Oshonhyi omuti omutalala nge osho tawu ningwa ngaanhyi, ongeepi mbela komuti omukukutu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Yesus okwa falwa a ka vipawe pamwe naalumenhu aakolokohi yaali. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Nhyi ya fika kehala ndyo, ha li ifanwa “Ekolotwe,” oya alele Yesus komushiyakano pamwe naakolokohi mbo yaali komishiyakano vawo, umwe okolulyo lwae namukwawo okolumoho lwae. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesus okwa ti, “Tate, ya vimina po eendjo vawo, oshonhyi kaye shii nhyi taa ningi.” Oya topolelafana oikutu yaYesus, pamukalo woku yi umbila oshihoololifo. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Aanhu oya li fikama ta ye mu tala, mhanga aakulunhu Aayuda ye mu sheka ya ti, “Okwa li ha hupifa aanhu, ne ihupife hano, nge oye Kilistus, omuhoololwa waKalunga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Aakwaita nayo oye ya kuye, ta ye mu sheke, ndee ta ye mu pe omaviinyu omalulu <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ndee taa ti, “Ihupifa hano, nge ooye ohamba yaYuda.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Eehapu vi ova li va shangwa pombada yomutwe wae, “NGU OYE OHAMBA yAayuda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Wumwe womaakolokohi okwe mu sheka ta ti, “Kooye Kilistus hano? Ihupifa hano oye u tu hupife!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ndele omukolokohi omukwawo okwe mu ngada a ti, “Iho tila Kalunga? Nase otu li mehandukilo lya fa ndi. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Okuhandukilwa kwetu okwa okuli mondjila, nhyi atu ningilwa osho ike nhyi twe ilongela, ndele ngu ina ninga nande ouyi washa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Onghee okwa ti kuYesus, “Yesus, vibuluka nge, nge wa fiki mOuhamba woe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Oshili andi ku lombwele, nena ndji oto ka kala pamwe naame moparadisa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eso lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateusa27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malukusa15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohanesa19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Efimbo lyomulongo nambali womutenya, okwe ya omilaulu moshilongo ashihe siyo opefimbo lyonhatu yokomatango. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Elapi ndi lya li lya topola motembeli, olya tauka pokati moipambu iyali kuza pombada siyo opohi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesus okwa ingiva mopale a ti, “Tate, omhepo yange andi yi yandja moikaha yoe.” Nanhyi a popya ngaanhyi, okwa si.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Omukulunhu waakwaita nhyi a mona ayihe mbi ya ningwa po, okwa simaneke Kalunga a ti, “Kapuna omalimbililo, omulumenhu ngu okwa li kena ondjo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Aanhu mba ya li ya ongala taa tala, nhyi ya mona nhyi sha ningwa po, ayehe oya shuna komaumbo ya sa oluhovi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Aanhu ayehe mba ya li ye shii Yesus, mwakwatelwa naakiinhu mba ya li ye mu landula kuza kuGalilea, oya li ya fikama kokule taa tala oinima ayihe.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efundiko lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateusa27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malukusa15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohanesa19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Okwa li ku na omulumenhu umwe evina lyaye oYosef. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Okwa li Omualimatia oshilando shomuYudea. Ye okwa li e na omikalo omiwa, ha ende moshili nokwa li a teelela ouhamba waKalunga. Nande nee ye okwa li oshilyo shaaleli, ye ka li a zimina omatokolo noilonga yawo. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Okwa ya ku Pilatus, ndee ta indile omuviba waYesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Okwe wu kufa, ndee te wu vigile melapi etokele te wu nangeke mombila ya li ya panda memanya, mu inamu tulwa nande omunhu nale. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Esiku olya li etitano, nEsabati olyali li li pokutameka.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Aakiinhu mba ya li ya landula Yesus oku za kuGalilea, oya li yaa naYosef. Oya mona ombila nanghee olutu lwaYesus lwa nangekwa mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Nhyi ya ya komaumbo, oya ka longekiva oiziba ya nyika nawa nomiwayo, ya ka yaeke omuviba. MEsabati oya vululukwa nganhyi sha ufwa komhango.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Eumuko lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateusa28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-18">Malukusa16:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohanesa20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ongula onene yesiku lyotango koshiike, aakiinhu oya ya kombila, ya fala ko oiziba mbi ya longekiva. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Nhyi ye ya posheelo shombila oya hanga emanya lya kandulwa po nale. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Oya ya mo, ndele omuviba woMwene Yesus inaye wu hanga mo. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Mhanga ya li ya limbililwa, ombaavilila, puyo opwa fikama aalumenhu yaali ya zala eenguwo a vi welima. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Aakiinhu oya haluka, ndee taa tu eengolo yeinyongamena. Aalumenhu mbo oye ya popifa ya ti, “Omolwashi amu kongo ngu e na omwenyo mokati kaasi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Keli mo mu, okwa umuvwa kousi. Vibulukeni nhyi e mu lombwelele mhanga a li muGalilea. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Okwa tile, ‘Omona wOmunhu oku na oku yandjwa moikaha yaalunde, ta ka alelwa komushiyakano, ndele mesiku etitatu, ota ka umuka kousi.’” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Aakiinhu oya vibuluka eehapu vaYesus. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Nhyi ya aluka ko kombila, oya hokolola ayihe mbi kaalongwa omulongo naumwe nokaanhu yamwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Aakiinhu mba oyo Malia Mahatalena, Johanna naMalia yina yaYakopo; pamwe naakiinhu yakwawo yamwe, oya hokololela aatumwa oinima ayihe mbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ndele aatumwa oya vilaavila kutya, nhyi ashi popiwa kaakiinhu kashi shi shoshili, onghee inaya itaela. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ndele Peetulusa okwa fikama, ndee ta tondokele kombila. Okwa hondamena mo, ndee okwa mona mo ike omalapi nga yali ya vigilwa omuviba. Okwa shuna keumbo a kuminwa nhyi sha ningwa po.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omishangwa vimwe kavi na ovelise omulongo nambali.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mondjila yokuEmmaus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Malukusa16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mesiku olyo tuu ndyo, yaali yomaalanduli yaYesus oya li taa ende ya uka komukunda wevina Emmaus, keli eekilometa omulongo nayimwe okuza kuYelusalema, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />taa kundafana ayihe mbi ya ningwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Mhanga taa kundafana, Yesus ye mwene okwe ya holokela, ndee ta ende pamwe nayo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Oye mu mona nghaa, okutya inaye mu vibuluka. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Amu kundafana shi molweendo lweni?” Oya fikama ya mwena noipala ya nyika oluhovi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Wumwe womuyo wevina Kleopas okwe mu pula, “Ooye auke womuYelusalema ino uva nhyi sha ningwa omasiku nga?<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Opwa ningwa shi? Oya yamukula ya ti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">“Oinima mbi ya ningilwa yaYesus Omunasaleta. Omulumenhu ngu okwa li omuhunganeki, e na eenghono moilonga nomeehapu, koshipala shaKalunga nokaanhu ayehe. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ndee aawiliki yaayambi naapangeli yetu oye mu yandja a pewe ehandukilo lyeso, ndee ta ye mu alele komushiyakano. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ndee se otwa li twe ineekela kutya omulumenhu ngu oye taka mangulula Aaislaeli. Nena nokuli esiku etitatu, konima nhyi ayihe mbi ya ningwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Aakiinhu yamwe yomokati ketu oye tu kumwifa, nhyi ya yile kombila ongula onene <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ndele omuviba waYesus inaye wu hanga ko. Nhyi ya aluka, oya hokolola kutya oya mona emoniko lyaayengeli, mba ye ya lombwela kutya Yesus okuna omwenyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Oku za mho, yamwe yomokati ketu oya ya ko kombila, ndele oya hanga ko naanaa nganhyi ya lombwelwa kaakiinhu, ndele Yesus ye mwene ina ye mu mona.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Kamu shi tuu omalai, nhyi omitima veni va nyengwa okwiitaela ayihe mbi ya popiwa kaahunganeki! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ndishi Kilistus okwa li nghaa e na okuhepekwa pamukalo mbu opo a ye meyavimo lyaye?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Opo nee Yesus okwe ya fatululila nhyi sha shangwa momishangwa avihe, okutameka momambo yaMoses siyo okomambo ayehe yaahunganeki. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nhyi ye ya popepi nomukunda mbo mu ya li taa yi, Yesus okwa ninga a fa ta pitilile po. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ndele oyemu lilila ya ti, “Kala puse, oshonhyi okwa toka, omilema ove ya.” Yesus okwa ya, ndee ta kala puyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Hano nhyi a kala omutumba poshililo pamwe nayo, okwa kufa omboloto, ndee ta pandula Kalunga, ndee teya pe. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Omeho yawo oya tonata, noye mu vibulula. Mepakumo lyeiho, okwa kana po. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Oya pulafana ya ti, “Kasha li shafa omundilo meemitima vetu nhyi a popya nase, ndee te tu fatululile nomishangwa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Oya fikama viyaviya, ndele taa shuna kuYelusalema, nghu ya hanga ko aalongwa omulongo naumwe ya ongala nooyakwawo yamwe <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ndee taa ti, “Kapu na omalimbililo, Omwene okwa umuka! Okwa monika kuSimoni!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Aalongwa mba yaali oye ya fatululile nhyi sha ningwa mondjila nanghee ya vibulula Omwene, konima nhyi a pambula omboloto.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus te ihololele aalongwa yaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateusa28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malukusa16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohanesa20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Oilonga1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Mhanga mba taa hokolola, Omwene Ye mwene okwa fikama mokati kayo, ndee ta ti kuyo, “Ombili nayi kale nanye.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Oya haluka noya kwatwa koumbada, Oshonhyi oya vilaavila kutya oya mona oshishitukila. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ndele okwa ti kuyo, “Omolwashi mwa tila? Omolwashi omitima veni va limbililwa? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Taleni omake yange neemhavi vage, opo mu vibulule kutya aame. Kumeni nge mu tale, shaanhyi oshilulu kashi na omasipa neenhumba nganhyi ndi li. <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nhyi a popya ngaanhyi, okwe ya ulikila omake neemhavi vaye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Oyali ya hafa unene nonghumwe, onghee natango ina ya itaela. Okwe ya pula ta ti, “Omu na po sha shokuliwa?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Oyemu pa okapambu kohi ya pya. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Okwe ka kufa, ndee te ka li monhaneho yawo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Okwa ti kuyo, “Oinima mbi oyo tuu mbi ndemu lombwela mhanga ndili punye nda ti; ayihe mbi ya shangwa momhango yaMoses tayi popi kombiga yange, nenge momanyolo yaahunganeki nenge momapisalomi, oyi na okuwanifwa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Opo nee okwa patulula omavilaavilo yawo, ya uve ko omishangwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ndee okwa ti kuyo, “Okwa shangwa kutya Kilistus okuna okuhepekwa, nomesiku etitatu, otaka umuka kousi. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Mevina lyaye aanhu ayehe oye na okuuvifilwa kutya naye itevulule opo Kalunga eya viminepo eendjo vawo, kutameka muYelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Onye eembagi voinima ayihe mbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Andike mu tumina nhyi Tate a uvaneka. Ndee kaleni moshilando mu, siyo amu pewa eenghono okuza meulu.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta falwa meulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malukusa16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Oilonga1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yesus okwa kufa mo aalongwa yaye moshilando, ndee te ya fala kuBetania. Mhanga ye li ngho, okwa yelufa oikaha yaye, ndele teya yambeke. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Moku ya yambeka, okwa kana po puyo, a falwa meulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Aalongwa oya tsu eengolo ndee taye mu inyongamene, ndee taa shuna kuYelusalema yena ehafo enene. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Oya kala aluhe motembeli, taa hambelele Kalunga.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>